            ['start_time' => 106.64, 'end_time' => 115.3, 'target_text' => 'In the interim, that\'s what we want to talk about." So, how is it a favor of Allah that he kept the date of death unknown', 'source_text' => 'Dan fasa kehidupan sementara inilah yang ingin kita bincangkan." Jadi, bagaimanakah dirahsiakannya tarikh kematian itu merupakan satu nikmat Allah', 'order' => 26],
