            ['start_time' => 132.61, 'end_time' => 139.11, 'target_text' => 'to witness people do whatever they wanted to up to the last moment, and right at the last minute you say, "Listen, guys, I\'ve', 'source_text' => 'melihat manusia bebas berbuat apa sahaja sekehendak hati mereka hingga ke saat akhir, lalu tepat pada saat-saat terakhir berkata: "Dengar sini kawan-kawan, saya ada', 'order' => 32],
