            ['start_time' => 199.09, 'end_time' => 203.39, 'target_text' => 'I\'d like to think, statistically, more than what it was before.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berpandangan, secara statistiknya, perkara ini berlaku jauh lebih kerap berbanding masa lampau.', 'order' => 51],
            ['start_time' => 203.49, 'end_time' => 205.99, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us a good understanding.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa mengurniakan kefahaman yang mendalam kepada kita.', 'order' => 52],
            ['start_time' => 206.09, 'end_time' => 213.99, 'target_text' => 'Now, the reason I also say this is because when we talk about the favors of Allah, no doubt, the best favor and the biggest', 'source_text' => 'Sebab saya berkata demikian juga adalah kerana apabila kita berbicara tentang nikmat Allah, tidak dapat dinafikan nikmat yang paling agung dan terbesar', 'order' => 53],
            ['start_time' => 214.09, 'end_time' => 219.99, 'target_text' => 'favor that Allah has given you and I is the acceptance to worship him alone.', 'source_text' => 'yang Allah kurniakan kepada anda dan saya ialah taufik untuk menyembah-Nya semata-mata.', 'order' => 54],
            ['start_time' => 220.09, 'end_time' => 230.19, 'target_text' => 'And the part of the ummah being a part of the ummah of Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam, those gifts are the biggest.', 'source_text' => 'Serta menjadi sebahagian daripada umat Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu \'Alaihi Wasallam; kurniaan itulah yang paling agung.', 'order' => 55],
            ['start_time' => 230.29, 'end_time' => 234.55, 'target_text' => 'Whether I\'ve had anything else after that is actually secondary.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada saya memiliki perkara lain selepas itu, hakikatnya ia hanyalah perkara sampingan.', 'order' => 56],
            ['start_time' => 234.65, 'end_time' => 236.59, 'target_text' => 'The fact that Allah chose you to worship him.', 'source_text' => 'Hakikat bahawa Allah memilih anda untuk beribadah kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 57],
            ['start_time' => 236.69, 'end_time' => 239.71, 'target_text' => 'And this is why I say, "Your time is limited.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sebab itulah saya katakan: "Masa anda amat terhad.', 'order' => 58],
            ['start_time' => 239.81, 'end_time' => 240.79, 'target_text' => 'Mine is limited.', 'source_text' => 'Masa saya juga amat terhad.', 'order' => 59],
            ['start_time' => 240.89, 'end_time' => 246.71, 'target_text' => 'Do you realize how much of time we spend in order to earn a livelihood?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda sedar betapa banyaknya masa yang kita luangkan semata-mata untuk mencari rezeki?', 'order' => 60],
            ['start_time' => 246.81, 'end_time' => 255.43, 'target_text' => 'And it\'s not wrong, but just to put into perspective the timing, how much time you spend working to earn a salary to be able', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukanlah satu kesalahan, tetapi sekadar untuk melihat masa dari sudut pandang yang tepat, berapa banyak masa anda bekerja demi gaji untuk', 'order' => 61],
            ['start_time' => 255.53, 'end_time' => 259.71, 'target_text' => 'to live a life of a slight bit of luxury for another month.', 'source_text' => 'menikmati kehidupan dengan sedikit keselesaan bagi tempoh sebulan lagi.', 'order' => 62],
            ['start_time' => 259.81, 'end_time' => 260.55, 'target_text' => 'That\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Itu sahaja.', 'order' => 63],
            ['start_time' => 260.65, 'end_time' => 262.75, 'target_text' => 'Or for another year, that\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Atau untuk setahun lagi, setakat itu sahaja.', 'order' => 64],
            ['start_time' => 262.85, 'end_time' => 273.27, 'target_text' => 'And so much of time Allah tells you, "Pause it for a few moments during the day to come to me, to remind you that true success', 'source_text' => 'Dan berulang kali Allah berpesan: "Berhentilah sejenak pada waktu siang untuk mengadap-Ku, bagi mengingatkan anda bahawa kejayaan sejati', 'order' => 65],
            ['start_time' => 273.37, 'end_time' => 275.07, 'target_text' => 'is in the five daily prayers.', 'source_text' => 'terletak pada solat fardu lima waktu.', 'order' => 66],
            ['start_time' => 275.17, 'end_time' => 276.75, 'target_text' => 'Did you ever know that?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda menyedari hakikat itu?', 'order' => 67],
            ['start_time' => 276.85, 'end_time' => 278.87, 'target_text' => 'True success is in your prayers.', 'source_text' => 'Kejayaan yang sebenar terletak di dalam solat anda.', 'order' => 68],
            ['start_time' => 278.97, 'end_time' => 284.31, 'target_text' => 'When you hear the mu\'adhin say "Hayya alal falah", that is a call from Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda mendengar muazin melaungkan "Hayya \'alal falah", itu adalah panggilan langsung daripada Allah.', 'order' => 69],
            ['start_time' => 284.41, 'end_time' => 287.47, 'target_text' => 'Allah is telling you, "Come to success.', 'source_text' => 'Allah sedang menyeru anda: "Marilah menuju kejayaan.', 'order' => 70],
            ['start_time' => 287.57, 'end_time' => 292.79, 'target_text' => 'Drop what you\'re doing." Many of us cannot drop it, do not drop it immediately.', 'source_text' => 'Tinggalkanlah apa yang sedang kamu lakukan." Namun ramai antara kita tidak mampu atau tidak mahu melepaskannya serta-merta.', 'order' => 71],
            ['start_time' => 292.89, 'end_time' => 296.63, 'target_text' => 'Allah wants to see >> [clears throat] >> what are you going to do?', 'source_text' => 'Allah ingin melihat apa yang bakal anda lakukan.', 'order' => 72],
            ['start_time' => 296.73, 'end_time' => 300.59, 'target_text' => 'You know the adhan, why does it have to be repeated so many times?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda tentang azan, mengapakah ia perlu diulang berkali-kali?', 'order' => 73],
            ['start_time' => 300.69, 'end_time' => 303.99, 'target_text' => 'Why is it called out loud for everyone to hear again and again?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa ia dilaungkan dengan lantang agar didengar oleh semua orang berulang-ulang kali?', 'order' => 74],
            ['start_time' => 304.09, 'end_time' => 309.31, 'target_text' => 'And even when the prayer is almost ready, we do what is known as iqama or takbir.', 'source_text' => 'Malah apabila solat hampir dimulakan, kita melakukan apa yang dinamakan iqamah atau takbir.', 'order' => 75],
            ['start_time' => 309.41, 'end_time' => 313.39, 'target_text' => 'We call it out just to prepare for the the saffs and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Kita melaungkannya untuk menyusun saf jemaah dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 76],
