            ['start_time' => 315.09, 'end_time' => 316.95, 'target_text' => 'Come to prayer, come to success.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah mendirikan solat, marilah menuju kejayaan.', 'order' => 78],
            ['start_time' => 317.05, 'end_time' => 322.55, 'target_text' => 'Allah is greater than anything you\'re doing, anything in existence besides him.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Besar melebihi apa jua urusan yang sedang anda lakukan, melebihi segala yang wujud selain daripada-Nya.', 'order' => 79],
            ['start_time' => 322.65, 'end_time' => 324.87, 'target_text' => 'Allah is greater than that.', 'source_text' => 'Allah jauh lebih agung daripada segala-galanya.', 'order' => 80],
            ['start_time' => 324.97, 'end_time' => 330.15, 'target_text' => 'Because there is none greater than Allah, so no matter what you\'re doing, Allah is saying, "Just come.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana tiada yang lebih agung daripada Allah, maka apa pun yang sedang anda lakukan, Allah berpesan: "Datanglah.', 'order' => 81],
            ['start_time' => 330.25, 'end_time' => 331.43, 'target_text' => 'Pray." How long will it take?', 'source_text' => 'Solatlah." Berapa lama sangat masa yang diperlukan?', 'order' => 82],
            ['start_time' => 331.53, 'end_time' => 333.35, 'target_text' => '5 minutes, not too long.', 'source_text' => 'Sekadar 5 minit, tidaklah lama.', 'order' => 83],
            ['start_time' => 333.45, 'end_time' => 335.27, 'target_text' => '10 minutes max, not too long.', 'source_text' => 'Paling lama pun 10 minit, tidak terlalu lama.', 'order' => 84],
            ['start_time' => 335.37, 'end_time' => 336.23, 'target_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 85],
            ['start_time' => 336.33, 'end_time' => 340.43, 'target_text' => 'A person reading a little bit longer like I do sometimes, 12 minutes, 2 more minutes.', 'source_text' => 'Jika seseorang membaca surah yang agak panjang seperti yang kadangkala saya lakukan, 12 minit, sekadar lebihan 2 minit lagi.', 'order' => 86],
            ['start_time' => 340.53, 'end_time' => 341.99, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah, not so often.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah, bukan selalu pun.', 'order' => 87],
            ['start_time' => 342.09, 'end_time' => 344.11, 'target_text' => 'But alhamdulillah, it\'s a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun alhamdulillah, itu juga satu nikmat kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 88],
            ['start_time' => 344.21, 'end_time' => 352.35, 'target_text' => 'So, one of the favors of Allah upon you and I that we don\'t realize is the acceptance to place your head on the ground for', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, salah satu nikmat Allah ke atas anda dan saya yang sering kita tidak sedari adalah taufik untuk meletakkan dahi di atas tanah demi menyembah', 'order' => 89],
            ['start_time' => 352.45, 'end_time' => 355.69, 'target_text' => 'him for a longer time.', 'source_text' => 'Nya dalam tempoh yang lebih lama.', 'order' => 90],
            ['start_time' => 355.85, 'end_time' => 357.51, 'target_text' => 'Did you hear what I just said?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda mendengar apa yang baru saya sampaikan tadi?', 'order' => 91],
            ['start_time' => 357.61, 'end_time' => 359.39, 'target_text' => 'The acceptance', 'source_text' => 'Iaitu taufik dan keizinan', 'order' => 92],
            ['start_time' => 359.49, 'end_time' => 364.35, 'target_text' => 'to place your head on the ground in sujud for Allah for a longer time.', 'source_text' => 'untuk meletakkan dahi anda di atas tanah dalam sujud kepada Allah dengan lebih lama.', 'order' => 93],
            ['start_time' => 364.45, 'end_time' => 368.97, 'target_text' => 'Because the Hadith says "Aqrabu ma yakunu', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sabda Nabi dalam hadis: "Aqrabu ma yakunul', 'order' => 94],
            ['start_time' => 370.25, 'end_time' => 376.15, 'target_text' => 'the closest that a slave can get to his Lord is in the position of prostration.', 'source_text' => 'keadaan paling dekat bagi seorang hamba dengan Tuhannya adalah sewaktu dia berada dalam keadaan bersujud.', 'order' => 95],
            ['start_time' => 376.25, 'end_time' => 379.39, 'target_text' => 'So it\'s a favor of Allah to help you to stay longer there.', 'source_text' => 'Maka ia adalah satu nikmat kurniaan Allah apabila Dia membantu anda untuk terus lama bersujud.', 'order' => 96],
            ['start_time' => 379.5, 'end_time' => 380.36, 'target_text' => 'In sujood.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam sujud.', 'order' => 97],
            ['start_time' => 380.45, 'end_time' => 387.44, 'target_text' => 'If you say subhana rabbiyal a\'la you have you have to say it once, it\'s better to say it thrice, and it\'s even better if you', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda membaca subhana rabbiyal a\'la, anda wajib menyebutnya sekali, lebih afdal menyebutnya tiga kali, dan lebih utama lagi jika anda', 'order' => 98],
            ['start_time' => 387.54, 'end_time' => 390.19, 'target_text' => 'could add another two, especially when you\'re reading alone.', 'source_text' => 'dapat menambah dua kali lagi (menjadikannya lima), terutamanya apabila anda solat bersendirian.', 'order' => 99],
            ['start_time' => 390.3, 'end_time' => 390.95, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 391.06, 'end_time' => 392.36, 'target_text' => 'You can add another few.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh menambah beberapa kali lagi.', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 392.45, 'end_time' => 399.15, 'target_text' => 'And sometimes subhana Allah uh we don\'t realize we\'re in such a rush and we\'re always in a rush.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kadang-kadang, subhanallah, kita tidak sedar bahawa kita sentiasa berada dalam keadaan tergesa-gesa.', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 399.25, 'end_time' => 402.24, 'target_text' => 'When is the quality of our prayer going to improve?', 'source_text' => 'Bilakah pula kualiti solat kita akan bertambah baik?', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 402.33, 'end_time' => 403.63, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah satu nikmat kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 403.74, 'end_time' => 409.56, 'target_text' => 'Now some might ask that look, Allah has already written and ordained what\'s going to happen.', 'source_text' => 'Kini mungkin ada yang bertanya: lihatlah, bukankah Allah telah menulis dan mentakdirkan apa yang bakal berlaku?', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 409.65, 'end_time' => 415.83, 'target_text' => 'My brothers, my sisters, Allah does not compel you to do things or not to do things.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudariku, Allah tidak memaksa anda untuk melakukan sesuatu atau melarang anda daripada berbuat sesuatu.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 415.94, 'end_time' => 423.88, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows what you would have chosen, but if Allah forced you to do things, he would not hold you accountable for that.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui apa yang akan menjadi pilihan anda, namun sekiranya Allah memaksa anda melakukan sesuatu, Dia sama sekali tidak akan menghisab anda atas perbuatan tersebut.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 423.98, 'end_time' => 433.31, 'target_text' => 'And in any time in your life, if you have not had a choice about something and it just happened without your role in it at', 'source_text' => 'Dan dalam fasa mana pun dalam kehidupan anda, jika anda langsung tiada pilihan terhadap sesuatu perkara dan ia berlaku tanpa sebarang peranan daripada anda', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 433.42, 'end_time' => 437.56, 'target_text' => 'all, Allah will never ask you about that, never.', 'source_text' => 'sama sekali, Allah tidak akan sesekali menyoal anda tentang perkara itu, tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 437.65, 'end_time' => 441.71, 'target_text' => 'You\'re walking, suddenly the ground opens and you fell and you got hurt.', 'source_text' => 'Ketika anda sedang berjalan, tiba-tiba tanah merekah lalu anda terjatuh dan mengalami kecederaan.', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 441.81, 'end_time' => 443.71, 'target_text' => 'Allah\'s not going to ask you why did the ground open?', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak akan menyoal anda mengapakah tanah itu merekah?', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 443.81, 'end_time' => 445.68, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to say, "How do I know?" Right?', 'source_text' => 'Anda tentu akan menjawab, "Bagaimana saya boleh tahu?" Benar bukan?', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 445.77, 'end_time' => 450.8, 'target_text' => 'You\'re driving normally and everything is okay and suddenly someone bashes into you.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang memandu seperti biasa dan segalanya baik-baik sahaja, tiba-tiba ada kenderaan lain merempuh anda.', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 450.89, 'end_time' => 455.39, 'target_text' => 'That person has to be questioned, not you, if you were driving according to the rules and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Orang itulah yang perlu dipersoalkan, bukannya anda, sekiranya anda telah memandu mengikut peraturan dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 455.5, 'end_time' => 457.68, 'target_text' => 'So this is what Allah says.', 'source_text' => 'Maka inilah yang dimaksudkan oleh Allah.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 457.77, 'end_time' => 464.19, 'target_text' => 'When the doctors tell us that you know what, your cholesterol\'s high, you need to do exercise, you need to do strength training,', 'source_text' => 'Apabila doktor memaklumkan kepada kita bahawa paras kolesterol kita tinggi, anda perlu bersenam, anda perlu lakukan latihan kekuatan,', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 464.3, 'end_time' => 465.63, 'target_text' => 'you need to do this, you need to do that.', 'source_text' => 'anda perlu lakukan ini, anda perlu lakukan itu.', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 465.74, 'end_time' => 466.83, 'target_text' => 'What happens to us?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku kepada kita?', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 466.94, 'end_time' => 471.24, 'target_text' => 'We immediately take heed and sometimes we get a tapping and then what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Kita serta-merta mengambil iktibar, kadangkala kita mendapat teguran kesihatan, dan selepas itu apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 471.33, 'end_time' => 478.04, 'target_text' => 'You have a little bit of a scare with your health and there comes a point when you change your life in order to live a little', 'source_text' => 'Anda merasa sedikit cemas tentang kesihatan anda, lalu tiba suatu saat di mana anda mengubah gaya hidup semata-mata untuk hidup sedikit', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 478.13, 'end_time' => 482.27, 'target_text' => 'bit longer, but you were not prepared to change your life for eternity.', 'source_text' => 'lebih lama, namun anda tidak bersedia mengubah gaya hidup demi kehidupan abadi di akhirat.', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 482.38, 'end_time' => 484.04, 'target_text' => 'You follow what I\'m saying?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda faham apa yang saya sampaikan ini?', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 484.13, 'end_time' => 487.72, 'target_text' => 'I\'m prepared to change my life because I want to live a few more years.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bersedia mengubah corak hidup saya semata-mata kerana mahu hidup beberapa tahun lagi.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 487.82, 'end_time' => 494.68, 'target_text' => 'The doctor says, "Look, I\'m 70, for example, and if you do X Y Z, inshallah, you live a bit longer and maybe a better quality', 'source_text' => 'Doktor berkata: "Katakan umur saya 70 tahun misalnya, jika anda lakukan sekian-sekian perkara, insya-Allah anda akan hidup lebih lama dan memiliki kualiti', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 494.78, 'end_time' => 499.56, 'target_text' => 'of life." I\'m prepared to change my life at 70 so that I can live to 80.', 'source_text' => 'hidup yang lebih baik." Saya bersedia mengubah hidup pada usia 70 tahun agar saya dapat hidup sehingga usia 80 tahun.', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 499.66, 'end_time' => 506.68, 'target_text' => 'But I haven\'t been prepared to change my life so beyond 80 when I go back to Allah, everything\'s waiting for me.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya belum bersedia mengubah hidup saya supaya selepas usia 80 tahun apabila kembali kepada Allah, ganjaran indah menanti saya.', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 506.78, 'end_time' => 514.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Do you know we will be waiting for you when you\'ve done things to meet us and you\'ve done things in preparation', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: "Tahukah kamu bahawa Kami sentiasa menanti kamu apabila kamu beramal soleh untuk bertemu Kami dan membuat persiapan', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 514.82, 'end_time' => 516.44, 'target_text' => 'to meet us, we\'re waiting for you.', 'source_text' => 'untuk mengadap Kami, Kami sentiasa menantikan kepulangan kamu.', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 516.54, 'end_time' => 518.16, 'target_text' => 'We want to give you the reward for it.', 'source_text' => 'Kami ingin mengurniakan ganjaran yang melimpah-ruah kerananya.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 518.26, 'end_time' => 525.52, 'target_text' => 'Before you actually pass on to the hereafter, the angels will come to you and they will say, \'Don\'t worry, no need to fear,', 'source_text' => 'Sebelum anda benar-benar melangkah ke alam akhirat, para malaikat akan mendatangi anda seraya berkata: \'Janganlah bimbang, usah takut,', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 525.62, 'end_time' => 530.76, 'target_text' => 'no need to worry, because you are going to paradise.\'" But when does that happen?', 'source_text' => 'dan usah bersedih, kerana sesungguhnya kamu bakal memasuki syurga.\'" Namun bilakah khabar gembira itu berlaku?', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 530.86, 'end_time' => 533.7, 'target_text' => 'Just before you die.', 'source_text' => 'Tepat sebelum anda menghembuskan nafas terakhir.', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 533.9, 'end_time' => 536.18, 'target_text' => 'Listen to the verse.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarkanlah ayat suci ini.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 555.46, 'end_time' => 556.12, 'target_text' => 'Amazing.', 'source_text' => 'Sungguh menakjubkan.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 556.22, 'end_time' => 564.68, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Those who said, \'Our Lord is Allah,\' and they were steadfast." Steadfast meaning they tried their best to do', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang menegaskan: \'Tuhan kami ialah Allah,\' kemudian mereka beristiqamah." Beristiqamah bermaksud mereka berusaha sedaya upaya melakukan', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 564.78, 'end_time' => 567.08, 'target_text' => 'what was right, to do what was pleasing to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'apa yang benar, melakukan apa yang diredhai oleh Allah.', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 567.18, 'end_time' => 571.4, 'target_text' => 'They tried their best to abstain from that which was displeasing to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berusaha bersungguh-sungguh menjauhi segala perkara yang dimurkai oleh Allah.', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 571.5, 'end_time' => 576.24, 'target_text' => 'Wherever they fell and faltered, they quickly made amends with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Di mana sahaja mereka tersilap langkah dan tergelincir, mereka segera bertaubat dan memohon keampunan daripada Allah.', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 576.34, 'end_time' => 576.92, 'target_text' => 'We are human.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah manusia biasa.', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 577.02, 'end_time' => 579.52, 'target_text' => 'It\'s never too late to make peace with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak pernah terlewat untuk kembali berdamai dan mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 579.62, 'end_time' => 582.36, 'target_text' => 'It\'s never too late to seek the pleasure of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak pernah terlambat untuk meraih keredhaan Allah.', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 582.46, 'end_time' => 583.88, 'target_text' => 'You just need to seek forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Anda hanya perlu memohon keampunan.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 583.98, 'end_time' => 586.04, 'target_text' => 'You fell again, you seek forgiveness again.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tergelincir lagi, mohonlah keampunan sekali lagi.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 586.14, 'end_time' => 593.96, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "When you say, \'My Lord is Allah,\' and you remain steadfast, the angels will come to you just prior to your death', 'source_text' => 'Allah menegaskan: "Apabila kamu berikrar \'Tuhanku ialah Allah\' dan kamu beristiqamah, para malaikat akan turun kepadamu saat menjelang kematian', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 594.06, 'end_time' => 596.64, 'target_text' => 'to say" What do they say?', 'source_text' => 'untuk menyampaikan" Apakah yang mereka sampaikan?', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 596.74, 'end_time' => 598.54, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 598.94, 'end_time' => 599.76, 'target_text' => 'be fearful.', 'source_text' => 'kamu berasa takut.', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 599.86, 'end_time' => 602.2, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be scared and don\'t be sad.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah kamu gentar dan janganlah kamu berdukacita.', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 602.3, 'end_time' => 607.76, 'target_text' => 'And we want to give you glad tidings of the paradise that you have been promised.', 'source_text' => 'Dan terimalah khabar gembira dengan syurga yang telah dijanjikan kepadamu.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 607.86, 'end_time' => 610.68, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why so many people pass away with a smile.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah ramai orang yang meninggal dunia dalam keadaan tersenyum.', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 610.78, 'end_time' => 612.04, 'target_text' => 'Have you ever noticed?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah anda memerhatikannya?', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 612.14, 'end_time' => 620.2, 'target_text' => 'If you have witnessed those who have passed away or you\'re a person who helps in the enshrouding and the washing of the deceased,', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda pernah menatap wajah orang yang telah meninggal dunia, atau anda membantu mengkafankan dan memandikan jenazah,', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 620.3, 'end_time' => 622.4, 'target_text' => 'you\'ll notice some people are smiling.', 'source_text' => 'anda akan dapati sesetengah jenazah kelihatan tersenyum manis.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 622.5, 'end_time' => 627.44, 'target_text' => 'Because they\'ve already been given get glad tidings by the help of Allah and his will.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana mereka telah pun diperlihatkan khabar gembira berkat pertolongan dan kehendak Allah.', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 627.54, 'end_time' => 630.8, 'target_text' => 'So, this is something that I would be seeking and you should be seeking.', 'source_text' => 'Maka inilah matlamat yang amat saya dambakan, dan sepatutnya anda dambakan juga.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 630.9, 'end_time' => 635.08, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy for us, but it requires a good heart.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memudahkannya untuk kita, namun ia menuntut hati yang bersih dan luhur.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 635.18, 'end_time' => 636.0, 'target_text' => 'A good heart.', 'source_text' => 'Hati yang suci.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 636.1, 'end_time' => 646.2, 'target_text' => 'The Hadith says, "Ala wa inna fil jasadi la mudghah idha saluhat saluhal jasadu kulluhu wa idha fasadat fasadal jasadu kulluhu', 'source_text' => 'Sabda Nabi dalam hadis: "Ala wa inna fil jasadi mudghatan, iza saluhat saluhal jasadu kulluh, wa iza fasadat fasadal jasadu kulluh,', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 646.3, 'end_time' => 647.44, 'target_text' => 'ala wa hiyal qalbu.', 'source_text' => 'ala wa hiyal qalb."', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 647.54, 'end_time' => 651.36, 'target_text' => 'Behold, in the body there is an organ, a piece of flesh.', 'source_text' => 'Ketahuilah bahawa di dalam tubuh badan itu ada seketul daging.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 651.46, 'end_time' => 656.04, 'target_text' => 'If it is good, pure, and clean, the whole body will be good, pure, and clean.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya ia baik, bersih, dan suci, maka eloklah seluruh anggota tubuh badan.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 656.14, 'end_time' => 658.08, 'target_text' => 'And if it is', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya ia', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 658.18, 'end_time' => 661.88, 'target_text' => 'sick, that\'s a word, if it is corrupt,', 'source_text' => 'berpenyakit, atau dengan erti kata lain rosak dan tercemar,', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 661.98, 'end_time' => 668.64, 'target_text' => 'if it is unwell, the whole body will be corrupt, the whole body will be sick, and so on." And then the Hadith says, "Behold,', 'source_text' => 'maka binasalah dan sakitlah seluruh anggota tubuh yang lain." Lalu sabda Nabi seterusnya: "Ketahuilah,', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 668.74, 'end_time' => 675.6, 'target_text' => 'that organ is actually or that piece of flesh is actually the heart." And look at the miracle of this Hadith.', 'source_text' => 'bahawa organ atau seketul daging itu hakikatnya adalah hati." Dan perhatikanlah mukjizat yang terkandung dalam hadis ini.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 675.7, 'end_time' => 680.8, 'target_text' => 'When the doctors want to tell you what\'s wrong with you, the first thing they say, "Go and get your bloods.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila doktor ingin mendiagnosis masalah kesihatan anda, perkara pertama yang mereka arahkan: "Pergi buat ujian darah.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 680.9, 'end_time' => 683.6, 'target_text' => 'Go and do your blood test." What does the blood test tell you?', 'source_text' => 'Pergi lakukan ujian darah." Apakah yang dapat dikesan melalui ujian darah tersebut?', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 683.7, 'end_time' => 684.92, 'target_text' => 'Everything.', 'source_text' => 'Segala-galanya.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 685.02, 'end_time' => 686.24, 'target_text' => 'It gives you everything.', 'source_text' => 'Ia merungkaikan segala maklumat kesihatan anda.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 686.34, 'end_time' => 690.88, 'target_text' => 'That\'s Allah telling you if the heart is clean, everything clean.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah tanda daripada Allah yang menunjukkan jika hatinya sihat, maka sihatlah segalanya.', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 690.98, 'end_time' => 692.16, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the heart?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah peranan jantung dan hati itu?', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 692.26, 'end_time' => 692.92, 'target_text' => 'What does it pump?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang dipamkannya?', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 693.02, 'end_time' => 694.36, 'target_text' => 'It pumps the blood.', 'source_text' => 'Ia mengepam darah ke serata badan.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 694.46, 'end_time' => 698.88, 'target_text' => 'It\'s basically the seat of the pumping of the blood of your entire body.', 'source_text' => 'Ia pada asasnya adalah pusat pengepaman darah bagi seluruh tubuh anda.', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 698.98, 'end_time' => 706.64, 'target_text' => 'And Allah\'s telling you even your physical diseases and sicknesses are known through that same blood.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah menunjukkan kepada anda bahawa penyakit fizikal anda pun dapat diketahui melalui darah yang sama itu.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 706.74, 'end_time' => 708.48, 'target_text' => 'What about your spiritual maladies?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pula dengan penyakit rohani dan jiwa anda?', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 708.58, 'end_time' => 709.8, 'target_text' => 'The same heart.', 'source_text' => 'Daripada hati yang sama juga.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 709.9, 'end_time' => 712.6, 'target_text' => 'You want to clean your heart, be a calm person.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda ingin menyucikan hati anda, jadilah insan yang tenang.', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 712.7, 'end_time' => 717.84, 'target_text' => 'Learn to understand it\'s not about me only, it\'s about us.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah untuk memahami bahawa kehidupan ini bukan tentang diri saya seorang sahaja, ia tentang kita bersama.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 717.94, 'end_time' => 725.36, 'target_text' => 'When you say it\'s about us, it\'s not going to be easy anymore because your own spouse, your own children, your own family', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda katakan ia tentang kita, ia bukan lagi perkara yang mudah kerana pasangan anda sendiri, anak-anak anda, ahli keluarga anda', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 725.46, 'end_time' => 732.04, 'target_text' => 'members, they will think different, they will behave in a different way, they will have different habits, they will have different', 'source_text' => 'sendiri, mereka mempunyai cara berfikir yang berbeza, bertindak dengan cara berbeza, mempunyai tabiat yang berbeza, serta cita rasa', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 732.14, 'end_time' => 733.24, 'target_text' => 'likes and dislikes.', 'source_text' => 'dan kegemaran yang berbeza-beza.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 733.34, 'end_time' => 735.28, 'target_text' => 'It\'s part of the plan of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Semua itu sebahagian daripada perancangan hikmah Allah.', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 735.38, 'end_time' => 737.44, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah satu nikmat kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 737.54, 'end_time' => 740.72, 'target_text' => 'You argue with your brother, not to the point where you start killing each other.', 'source_text' => 'Anda bertelingkah dengan saudara anda, namun janganlah sampai ke tahap bermusuhan dan mencederakan antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 740.82, 'end_time' => 745.96, 'target_text' => 'You have a disagreement with your sister, your spouse, not to the point where you become physical and you harm each other.', 'source_text' => 'Anda berbeza pandangan dengan saudari anda atau pasangan anda, namun janganlah sampai ke tahap kekerasan fizikal dan saling menyakiti.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 746.06, 'end_time' => 747.68, 'target_text' => 'You need to take it in your stride.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu menerimanya dengan lapang dada dan sabar.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 747.78, 'end_time' => 750.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah says there\'s a reward in being the bigger person.', 'source_text' => 'Allah menetapkan bahawa ada ganjaran besar bagi mereka yang berjiwa besar dan beralah demi kebaikan.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 750.82, 'end_time' => 751.72, 'target_text' => 'You know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 751.82, 'end_time' => 754.6, 'target_text' => 'Because it would have been so boring if all of us were the same.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana hidup ini pasti membosankan sekiranya setiap daripada kita diciptakan serupa belaka.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 754.7, 'end_time' => 755.32, 'target_text' => 'So boring.', 'source_text' => 'Terlalu membosankan.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 755.42, 'end_time' => 756.4, 'target_text' => 'We\'ve said it so many times.', 'source_text' => 'Kita telah mengulanginya berkali-kali.', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 756.5, 'end_time' => 758.12, 'target_text' => 'Moments ago, what did I say?', 'source_text' => 'Sebentar tadi, apa yang saya katakan?', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 758.22, 'end_time' => 761.04, 'target_text' => 'If you knew your date of death, it would not be a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda mengetahui tarikh kematian anda, ia bukanlah satu nikmat daripada Allah.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 761.14, 'end_time' => 765.32, 'target_text' => 'I want to prove to you if we were all the same, it would never be a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Kini saya ingin buktikan kepada anda bahawa jika kita semua sama sahaja, ia langsung tidak akan menjadi satu nikmat Allah.', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 765.42, 'end_time' => 770.24, 'target_text' => 'Imagine if you and I thought the same, ate the same, did the same, it would be so boring.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan jika anda dan saya berfikiran sama, makan hidangan yang sama, berkelakuan serupa, hidup ini pasti amat hambar.', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 770.34, 'end_time' => 772.44, 'target_text' => 'It\'s good that I can see you and recognize you.', 'source_text' => 'Alangkah eloknya saya dapat melihat anda dan mengenali keperibadian anda.', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 772.54, 'end_time' => 778.2, 'target_text' => 'Hey, that\'s brother this and brother that and so and you know me and I know you and some of us know each other for the character.', 'source_text' => 'Ini saudara sekian dan itu saudara sekian, anda mengenali saya dan saya mengenali anda, malah kita mengenali watak masing-masing.', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 778.3, 'end_time' => 782.64, 'target_text' => 'Watch out for this guy, he\'s a bit short wire as they call it, you know, short circuit.', 'source_text' => '"Hati-hati dengan orang ini, dia cepat panas baran seperti litar pintas."', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 782.74, 'end_time' => 783.84, 'target_text' => 'He gets angry very quickly.', 'source_text' => 'Dia mudah naik marah.', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 783.94, 'end_time' => 784.6, 'target_text' => 'Be careful.', 'source_text' => 'Berhati-hatilah.', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 784.7, 'end_time' => 788.12, 'target_text' => 'Look how you We know each other and we love each other that way.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah bagaimana kita mengenali dan mengasihi antara satu sama lain dengan kepelbagaian watak itu.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 788.22, 'end_time' => 790.96, 'target_text' => 'If it was any other way, it would have been so boring.', 'source_text' => 'Jika sebaliknya, dunia ini pasti menjadi amat hambar dan membosankan.', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 791.06, 'end_time' => 791.92, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 792.02, 'end_time' => 799.92, 'target_text' => 'And we earn from each other because Allah\'s kept different needs and different people fulfilling those needs, but Allah didn\'t', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita saling mencari rezeki sesama kita kerana Allah menetapkan keperluan berbeza dan insan berbeza untuk memenuhi keperluan tersebut, walaupun Allah tidak', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 800.02, 'end_time' => 802.12, 'target_text' => 'need to use those people, but he does.', 'source_text' => 'perlu bergantung kepada sesiapa, namun itulah sunnatullah yang Dia tetapkan.', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 802.22, 'end_time' => 806.24, 'target_text' => 'For example, I\'m not a baker, I\'m not a doctor, an accountant, a lawyer.', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai contoh, saya bukan pembuat roti, bukan doktor, bukan akauntan, dan bukan peguam.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 806.34, 'end_time' => 807.44, 'target_text' => 'I need an accountant.', 'source_text' => 'Saya memerlukan khidmat akauntan.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 807.54, 'end_time' => 808.4, 'target_text' => 'I may need a lawyer.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mungkin memerlukan khidmat peguam.', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 808.5, 'end_time' => 813.52, 'target_text' => 'I may need a doc Someone else is and in my field, you may need my services as well.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mungkin memerlukan doktor, dan dalam bidang saya pula, anda mungkin memerlukan bimbingan saya.', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 813.62, 'end_time' => 815.36, 'target_text' => 'Each person cannot do everything.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap insan tidak mampu melakukan segala-galanya sendirian.', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 815.46, 'end_time' => 816.84, 'target_text' => 'You can do two or three things.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin berkebolehan dalam dua atau tiga perkara sahaja.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 816.94, 'end_time' => 821.32, 'target_text' => 'That\'s part of the favor of Allah so that we are forced to interact with each other.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebahagian daripada nikmat Allah agar kita saling berhubung dan berinteraksi antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 821.42, 'end_time' => 826.88, 'target_text' => 'A few days ago, I was dealing with a crisis in a family somewhere in another country.', 'source_text' => 'Beberapa hari lalu, saya mengendalikan satu krisis kekeluargaan di sebuah negara lain.', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 826.98, 'end_time' => 830.72, 'target_text' => 'And I told these warring factions of the same family that you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya berpesan kepada pihak yang bertelingkah dalam keluarga tersebut:', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 830.82, 'end_time' => 834.4, 'target_text' => 'You are going to have to talk to each other.', 'source_text' => '"Kamu berdua wajib bercakap dan berbincang sesama sendiri.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 834.5, 'end_time' => 840.28, 'target_text' => 'Whether you like it or you don\'t like it, you will have to talk to each other.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada kamu suka atau tidak suka, kamu mesti duduk berbincang antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 840.38, 'end_time' => 842.52, 'target_text' => 'No, I disown this There\'s no disowning.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada istilah buang keluarga atau memutuskan hubungan silaturahim.', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 842.62, 'end_time' => 843.88, 'target_text' => 'You have to talk to them.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu mesti bercakap dengan mereka.', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 843.98, 'end_time' => 846.4, 'target_text' => 'You are going to have to solve this problem.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu wajib menyelesaikan masalah ini.', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 846.5, 'end_time' => 848.12, 'target_text' => 'And I\'m telling you it\'s the favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya tegaskan bahawa peluang berdamai ini adalah nikmat daripada Allah."', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 848.22, 'end_time' => 851.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah says la khaira fee kathirin', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: "La khayra fi kathirin', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 851.82, 'end_time' => 859.46, 'target_text' => 'min najwahum illa man amara bi sadaqatin aw ma\'rufin aw isla', 'source_text' => 'min najwahum illa man amara bi sadaqatin aw ma\'rufin aw islahin baynan-nas."', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 860.78, 'end_time' => 867.32, 'target_text' => '>> There is no goodness in the private meetings that people have unless you are encouraging people to give charity and unless', 'source_text' => 'Tiada kebaikan pada kebanyakan bisikan atau perjumpaan rahsia mereka, melainkan orang yang menyuruh bersedekah, atau', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 867.42, 'end_time' => 874.24, 'target_text' => 'you are resolving disputes between people or unless you are encouraging people to do something good.', 'source_text' => 'mendamaikan perselisihan antara manusia, atau menyuruh berbuat kebaikan.', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 874.34, 'end_time' => 876.76, 'target_text' => 'So if I sit I say brother I\'d like to meet you.', 'source_text' => 'Maka jika saya mengajak: "Saudaraku, saya ingin berjumpa dengan anda."', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 876.86, 'end_time' => 877.68, 'target_text' => 'What am I meeting you for?', 'source_text' => 'Atas tujuan apakah pertemuan itu?', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 877.78, 'end_time' => 883.76, 'target_text' => 'I can meet you for anything but the best meetings when I\'m telling you to give a charity, when I\'m telling you to do something', 'source_text' => 'Kita boleh berjumpa atas apa jua urusan, namun sebaik-baik pertemuan adalah apabila saya mengajak anda bersedekah, mengajak anda melakukan', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 883.86, 'end_time' => 891.32, 'target_text' => 'good or when I\'m telling you to solve a problem between you and your brother or we are solving the problem then it might not', 'source_text' => 'kebaikan, atau mengajak anda menyelesaikan pertelingkahan antara anda dengan saudara anda; walaupun penyelesaian itu mungkin', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 891.42, 'end_time' => 892.08, 'target_text' => 'be easy.', 'source_text' => 'tidak mudah.', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 892.18, 'end_time' => 894.8, 'target_text' => 'How many times do we meet to solve a problem?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa kali kita perlu berjumpa untuk merungkaikan sesuatu masalah?', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 894.9, 'end_time' => 895.8, 'target_text' => 'There\'s no limit to that.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada had masa atau batasan untuk itu.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 895.9, 'end_time' => 898.48, 'target_text' => 'I can meet you 1,000 times.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sanggup berjumpa dengan anda sebanyak 1,000 kali.', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 898.58, 'end_time' => 901.2, 'target_text' => 'The reward is not necessarily in the solution.', 'source_text' => 'Pahala dan ganjaran besar tidak semestinya terletak pada tercapainya solusi semata-mata.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 901.3, 'end_time' => 902.84, 'target_text' => 'It\'s in the trial.', 'source_text' => 'Ganjaran itu ada pada usaha dan kesabaran dalam mencuba.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 902.94, 'end_time' => 905.72, 'target_text' => 'Because some people might not agree.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana sesetengah pihak mungkin belum bersetuju.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 905.82, 'end_time' => 909.48, 'target_text' => 'And by all means if you owe someone money, don\'t use my speech to go and say let\'s solve it.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sudah tentu, jika anda berhutang wang dengan seseorang, jangan gunakan ceramah saya ini untuk berkata \'mari kita selesaikan\'.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 909.58, 'end_time' => 911.12, 'target_text' => 'Now you know you can forgive me.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu anda berkata: \'Sekarang kamu perlu halalkan hutang saya.\'', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 911.22, 'end_time' => 912.8, 'target_text' => 'You owe them the money, you give them the money.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda berhutang wang dengan mereka, anda wajib bayar wang tersebut!', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 912.9, 'end_time' => 914.32, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 914.42, 'end_time' => 915.8, 'target_text' => 'You owe them something, you give it to them.', 'source_text' => 'Jika ada hak orang lain pada anda, pulangkanlah hak itu kepada mereka.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 915.9, 'end_time' => 919.2, 'target_text' => 'But what I mean is generally we have disputes over petty thing.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi maksud saya ialah kita lazimnya bertelingkah atas perkara-perkara yang remeh-temeh.', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 919.3, 'end_time' => 927.68, 'target_text' => 'Today we\'d like to seize this opportunity to go back and revise our disputes and look at all of those that we can easily resolve', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini marilah kita mengambil peluang ini untuk menilai kembali perselisihan kita, meneliti mana yang boleh diselesaikan dengan mudah', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 927.78, 'end_time' => 928.68, 'target_text' => 'and start with them.', 'source_text' => 'dan mulakan langkah penyelesaian dengannya.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 928.78, 'end_time' => 929.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah will bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah pasti akan melimpahkan keberkatan kepada anda.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 929.82, 'end_time' => 931.32, 'target_text' => 'Why do I say this?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah saya berpesan sebegini?', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 931.42, 'end_time' => 933.64, 'target_text' => 'I say it', 'source_text' => 'Saya mengatakannya', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 933.74, 'end_time' => 944.68, 'target_text' => 'with a backdrop of a crisis in the Muslim ummah where there is fighting, killing, destruction, nations are being plundered.', 'source_text' => 'dengan berlatarbelakangkan krisis yang melanda umat Islam, di mana berlakunya perbalahan, pembunuhan, kemusnahan, dan negara yang dijarah.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 944.78, 'end_time' => 948.28, 'target_text' => 'So much is happening for one reason.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu banyak musibah berlaku berpunca daripada satu sebab utama.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 948.38, 'end_time' => 951.18, 'target_text' => 'The main reason is because', 'source_text' => 'Punca utamanya adalah kerana', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 951.46, 'end_time' => 953.4, 'target_text' => 'we\'re doing it to each other.', 'source_text' => 'kita sendiri yang melakukannya sesama kita.', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 953.5, 'end_time' => 954.8, 'target_text' => 'And we have no respect.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita hilang rasa hormat.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 954.9, 'end_time' => 955.84, 'target_text' => 'We could not resolve.', 'source_text' => 'Kita gagal mencari jalan damai.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 955.94, 'end_time' => 956.96, 'target_text' => 'We could not sit.', 'source_text' => 'Kita enggan duduk semeja berbincang.', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 957.06, 'end_time' => 964.72, 'target_text' => 'Any crisis you witness today among the Muslims, you can sit together, talk again and again and again, compromise a little', 'source_text' => 'Apa jua krisis yang anda saksikan dalam kalangan umat Islam hari ini, kita mampu duduk bersama, berbincang berulang-ulang kali, bertolak ansur sedikit', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 964.82, 'end_time' => 965.6, 'target_text' => 'bit this way, a little bit that.', 'source_text' => 'dari sudut ini, dan bertolak ansur sedikit dari sudut itu.', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 965.7, 'end_time' => 969.64, 'target_text' => 'You can resolve it if both parties are prepared to resolve it.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti dapat merungkaikannya sekiranya kedua-dua pihak bersedia untuk berdamai.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 969.74, 'end_time' => 973.4, 'target_text' => 'You know when Allah speaks about husband and wife in the Quran, you know what he says?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apabila Allah berfirman tentang hubungan suami isteri di dalam Al-Quran, apa yang dinyatakan-Nya?', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 973.5, 'end_time' => 977.16, 'target_text' => 'He says, "Look, when you have a problem and you\'re bound to have a problem, solve it.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berpesan: "Apabila berlaku perselisihan—dan perselisihan pasti berlaku—selesaikanlah ia.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 977.26, 'end_time' => 978.04, 'target_text' => 'Talk to each other.', 'source_text' => 'Bercakaplah antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 978.14, 'end_time' => 979.64, 'target_text' => 'Communication must be strong.', 'source_text' => 'Komunikasi mestilah kukuh dan jelas.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 979.74, 'end_time' => 984.6, 'target_text' => 'In the Quran, and Allah tells you, "Look, if you still have a problem, perhaps you want to take it one step further.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam Al-Quran, Allah turut mengajar: "Jika kamu masih menghadapi kebuntuan, majulah selangkah lagi.', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 984.7, 'end_time' => 987.16, 'target_text' => 'Appoint someone from this family, someone from that family.', 'source_text' => 'Lantiklah seorang wakil daripada keluarga ini, dan seorang wakil daripada keluarga itu.', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 987.26, 'end_time' => 993.76, 'target_text' => 'Let them get together and talk to each other and resolve the matter." And Allah says, "In you read', 'source_text' => 'Biarkan mereka bersemuka, berbincang, dan mencari jalan damai." Dan firman Allah seterusnya: "In yurida', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 993.86, 'end_time' => 995.36, 'target_text' => 'Islaah,', 'source_text' => 'islahan,', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 995.46, 'end_time' => 1004.48, 'target_text' => 'you will seek Allah between them." If both parties want to solve the problem, Allah will grant them acceptance to resolve', 'source_text' => 'yuwaffiqillahu baynahuma." Sekiranya kedua-dua pihak ikhlas mahukan perdamaian, Allah akan memberikan taufik untuk mereka berdamai.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 1004.58, 'end_time' => 1005.72, 'target_text' => 'it.', 'source_text' => 'dan menyelesaikan kemelut tersebut.', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 1005.82, 'end_time' => 1009.12, 'target_text' => 'The problem is one party wants to resolve it, the other one doesn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Masalahnya sekarang ialah apabila sebelah pihak mahu berdamai, tetapi sebelah pihak lagi enggan.', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 1009.22, 'end_time' => 1010.8, 'target_text' => 'You want to solve a problem?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda benar-benar ingin menyelesaikan masalah?', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 1010.9, 'end_time' => 1013.6, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to have to compromise a little bit here and there.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu bersedia bertolak ansur sedikit di sana dan di sini.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 1013.7, 'end_time' => 1014.1, 'target_text' => 'Here and there.', 'source_text' => 'Di pelbagai sudut.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 1014.18, 'end_time' => 1016.24, 'target_text' => 'You might have to give and take.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu ada sifat memberi dan menerima.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 1016.34, 'end_time' => 1017.48, 'target_text' => 'But what about this?', 'source_text' => 'Namun bagaimana pula dengan hal ini?', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 1017.58, 'end_time' => 1024.4, 'target_text' => 'If you really want to solve it, sometimes there is a bigger reward in letting go of a little', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda benar-benar mahukan perdamaian, kadangkala ganjaran yang jauh lebih besar terletak pada kesediaan melepaskan sedikit hak', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 1024.5, 'end_time' => 1033.76, 'target_text' => 'for the sake of peace and making that peace than to fight for the little that will disrupt your peace beyond the amount that', 'source_text' => 'demi memelihara keamanan dan menjalinkan persaudaraan, daripada berkeras menuntut perkara kecil yang meragut ketenteraman jiwa melebihi nilai', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 1033.86, 'end_time' => 1036.42, 'target_text' => 'that problem is worth.', 'source_text' => 'masalah itu sendiri.', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 1036.74, 'end_time' => 1039.8, 'target_text' => 'Few days ago, there was a young person I met.', 'source_text' => 'Beberapa hari lepas, ada seorang anak muda yang saya temui.', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 1039.9, 'end_time' => 1042.24, 'target_text' => 'Very, very scrunched up face.', 'source_text' => 'Wajahnya kelihatan amat berkerut dan tegang.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 1042.34, 'end_time' => 1046.36, 'target_text' => 'And I said, "Brother, how are you?" He says, "I\'m fine." I said, "What\'s your name?" He gave me his name.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu saya menyapa: "Saudaraku, apa khabar?" Dia menjawab: "Saya baik-baik sahaja." Saya bertanya namanya, dan dia memberitahu namanya.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 1046.46, 'end_time' => 1049.8, 'target_text' => 'I said, "Is everything okay?" He says, "No." What\'s the problem?', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya: "Adakah semuanya baik?" Dia menjawab: "Tidak." Apakah puncanya?', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 1049.9, 'end_time' => 1051.8, 'target_text' => 'And he gave me a a little bit of it.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu dia menceritakan sedikit sebanyak kisahnya.', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 1051.9, 'end_time' => 1053.24, 'target_text' => 'And I told him, "May Allah bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya mendoakannya: "Semoga Allah merahmati anda.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 1053.34, 'end_time' => 1055.64, 'target_text' => 'How old are you?" He says, "22."', 'source_text' => 'Berapakah umur anda?" Dia menjawab: "22 tahun."', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 1055.74, 'end_time' => 1057.48, 'target_text' => '22.', 'source_text' => 'Baru 22 tahun.', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 1057.58, 'end_time' => 1064.96, 'target_text' => 'And he\'s so sc- because he\'s he had whatever problem he had, it was a dispute within his family and a little bit beyond.', 'source_text' => 'Dan wajahnya begitu tegang kerana apa jua masalah yang dihadapinya berpunca daripada pertelingkahan keluarga dan hal-hal lain.', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 1065.06, 'end_time' => 1068.44, 'target_text' => 'But his face was scrunched, and his expression was that.', 'source_text' => 'Namun wajahnya berkerut masam dan riak mukanya kelihatan begitu keruh.', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 1068.54, 'end_time' => 1071.52, 'target_text' => 'So, automatically these lines remained.', 'source_text' => 'Sehingga garisan kerutan itu mula kekal di dahinya.', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 1071.62, 'end_time' => 1072.6, 'target_text' => 'They remained.', 'source_text' => 'Garisan kerutan itu melekat di wajahnya.', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 1072.7, 'end_time' => 1076.16, 'target_text' => 'Because when you scrunch your face, it\'s against the Sunnah.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana apabila anda bermuka masam dan berkerut dahi, ia bertentangan dengan sunnah.', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 1076.26, 'end_time' => 1077.48, 'target_text' => 'Did you know that?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda tentang perkara itu?', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 1077.58, 'end_time' => 1081.86, 'target_text' => 'The Prophet Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam tells you to have a pleasant', 'source_text' => 'Nabi Sallallahu \'Alaihi Wasallam mengajarkan kita agar sentiasa menampilkan wajah', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 1082.1, 'end_time' => 1083.9, 'target_text' => 'look.', 'source_text' => 'yang manis dan menyenangkan.', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 1084.18, 'end_time' => 1086.32, 'target_text' => 'Carry yourself with a pleasant look.', 'source_text' => 'Bawalah diri anda dengan air muka yang ceria.', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 1086.42, 'end_time' => 1089.16, 'target_text' => 'Push yourself that your expression is pleasant.', 'source_text' => 'Didiklah diri anda agar raut wajah sentiasa memancarkan kemesraan.', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 1089.26, 'end_time' => 1096.36, 'target_text' => 'To the point that the Hadith says, "If you actually break into a smile, we\'re going to reward you as though you gave a charity."', 'source_text' => 'Sehinggakan hadis menyatakan bahawa senyuman anda kepada saudara anda akan diberi ganjaran pahala seumpama anda bersedekah.', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 1096.46, 'end_time' => 1098.24, 'target_text' => 'If I look at you, it\'s salaam alaikum.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila saya memandang anda, saya mengucapkan: "Assalamualaikum."', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 1098.34, 'end_time' => 1099.88, 'target_text' => 'I broke into a smile.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mengukirkan senyuman manis.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 1099.98, 'end_time' => 1100.4, 'target_text' => 'What happens?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku?', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 1100.5, 'end_time' => 1107.08, 'target_text' => 'I get a reward of a charity as though I gave some money somewhere, as though I did something because I\'ve helped myself and', 'source_text' => 'Saya beroleh pahala sedekah seolah-olah saya mendermakan wang atau menyumbang sesuatu kebaikan, kerana saya telah membahagiakan diri saya dan', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 1107.18, 'end_time' => 1107.88, 'target_text' => 'everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'orang lain di sekeliling saya.', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 1107.98, 'end_time' => 1114.8, 'target_text' => 'So, go out of your way to to look at how you beam energy from yourself.', 'source_text' => 'Maka berusahalah sedaya upaya untuk memerhatikan tenaga dan aura yang anda pancarkan daripada diri anda.', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 1114.9, 'end_time' => 1116.68, 'target_text' => 'It needs to be a positive energy.', 'source_text' => 'Ia mestilah tenaga yang positif dan membina.', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 1116.78, 'end_time' => 1118.16, 'target_text' => 'Allah will help you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah pasti akan membantu anda.', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 1118.26, 'end_time' => 1122.56, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have a problem by the will of Allah if you compare it to other people\'s problems.', 'source_text' => 'Dengan keizinan Allah, anda sebenarnya tidak mempunyai masalah besar jika dibandingkan dengan masalah orang lain.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 1122.66, 'end_time' => 1124.88, 'target_text' => 'Always look at the problems of others.', 'source_text' => 'Sentiasalah melihat kepada kesusahan orang lain.', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 1124.98, 'end_time' => 1126.96, 'target_text' => 'That\'s another favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itu juga satu lagi nikmat kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 1127.06, 'end_time' => 1128.36, 'target_text' => 'You know what it is?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah nikmat itu?', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 1128.46, 'end_time' => 1132.56, 'target_text' => 'Allah\'s favor upon you is that there are others who have bigger problems than yours.', 'source_text' => 'Nikmat Allah ke atas anda ialah hakikat bahawa ada insan lain yang menanggung ujian jauh lebih berat daripada anda.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 1132.66, 'end_time' => 1133.48, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 1133.58, 'end_time' => 1135.24, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t look at it that way.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kita sering kali tidak memandangnya dari sudut itu.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1135.34, 'end_time' => 1136.52, 'target_text' => 'What problem do you have?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah masalah yang sedang anda hadapi?', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1136.62, 'end_time' => 1137.24, 'target_text' => 'Hey, you know what?', 'source_text' => '"Wah, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1137.34, 'end_time' => 1138.68, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t have school fees to pay.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak mempunyai wang untuk membayar yuran sekolah."', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1138.78, 'end_time' => 1142.28, 'target_text' => 'There\'s people who don\'t have money to buy food.', 'source_text' => 'Di luar sana ada orang yang langsung tiada wang walau sekadar untuk membeli sesuap makanan!', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1142.38, 'end_time' => 1144.52, 'target_text' => 'Subhanallah, I\'m not saying this is not a problem.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah, saya tidak mengatakan bahawa kesempitan yuran itu bukan satu masalah.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1144.62, 'end_time' => 1145.36, 'target_text' => 'It is.', 'source_text' => 'Ia sememangnya satu masalah.', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1145.46, 'end_time' => 1147.8, 'target_text' => 'But inshallah, you will thank Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun insya-Allah, anda akan tetap bersyukur kepada Allah.', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1147.9, 'end_time' => 1155.16, 'target_text' => 'So, Allah says, "When you thank me for the favors, when you thank me for the favors upon you, I will bless you with more favors."', 'source_text' => 'Maka Allah menegaskan: "Apabila kamu bersyukur kepada-Ku atas segala nikmat-Ku kepadamu, nescaya Aku akan menambah lagi nikmat-Ku kepadamu."', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1155.26, 'end_time' => 1156.56, 'target_text' => 'How do I thank Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah caranya untuk saya bersyukur kepada Allah?', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1156.66, 'end_time' => 1158.32, 'target_text' => 'I need to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Saya wajib mendirikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1158.42, 'end_time' => 1161.64, 'target_text' => 'I need to try my best to carry myself as a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Saya perlu berusaha sedaya upaya membawa diri saya sebagai seorang Muslim sejati.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1161.74, 'end_time' => 1169.0, 'target_text' => 'What that means is men and women, both, we need to dress in a way that when someone sees us, they look at us from far, immediately', 'source_text' => 'Maksudnya bagi lelaki mahupun wanita, kita perlu berpakaian dengan sopan dan menutup aurat sehingga apabila dipandang dari kejauhan, mereka terus menyapa:', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1169.1, 'end_time' => 1170.4, 'target_text' => 'Assalamualaikum.', 'source_text' => '"Assalamualaikum."', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1170.5, 'end_time' => 1172.04, 'target_text' => 'They know this person\'s a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka serta-merta tahu bahawa orang ini ialah seorang Muslim.', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1172.14, 'end_time' => 1172.92, 'target_text' => 'It\'s so difficult.', 'source_text' => 'Kini ia menjadi begitu mencabar.', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1173.02, 'end_time' => 1177.32, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes you look at someone, you really don\'t know should we greet them with salaam, should we not?', 'source_text' => 'Kadang-kadang apabila anda melihat seseorang, anda benar-benar ragu-ragu sama ada patut memberi salam atau tidak.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1177.42, 'end_time' => 1180.92, 'target_text' => 'Imagine greeting a non-Muslim in', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan memberi salam kepada orang bukan Islam di dalam', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1181.02, 'end_time' => 1183.72, 'target_text' => 'an environment of Islamophobia with Assalamualaikum.', 'source_text' => 'suasana yang sarat dengan sentimen Islamofobia.', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1183.82, 'end_time' => 1186.8, 'target_text' => 'Imagine how they would react with you or to you.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan bagaimana reaksi mereka terhadap anda.', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1186.9, 'end_time' => 1188.76, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not easy anymore.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukan lagi perkara yang mudah.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1188.86, 'end_time' => 1195.92, 'target_text' => 'So, my beloved brothers and sisters, let\'s consider these points because the favors of Allah are many.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, wahai saudara-saudariku yang dikasihi, marilah kita renungkan perkara ini kerana nikmat kurniaan Allah itu amat banyak.', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1196.02, 'end_time' => 1201.16, 'target_text' => 'We need to We need to make sure we appreciate them.', 'source_text' => 'Kita perlu memastikan bahawa kita benar-benar menghargai segala nikmat-Nya.', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1201.26, 'end_time' => 1203.6, 'target_text' => 'And we Allah will bless us with much more.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah pasti akan melimpahkan lebih banyak lagi kebaikan kepada kita.', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1203.7, 'end_time' => 1208.04, 'target_text' => 'The temporary life on this earth I\'d like to ask you a question.', 'source_text' => 'Mengenai kehidupan sementara di dunia ini, saya ingin mengajukan satu soalan kepada anda.', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1208.14, 'end_time' => 1210.52, 'target_text' => 'How long would you like to live for?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa lamakah anda ingin hidup di dunia ini?', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1210.62, 'end_time' => 1211.44, 'target_text' => 'Question.', 'source_text' => 'Satu soalan.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1211.54, 'end_time' => 1212.28, 'target_text' => 'How many years?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa tahun?', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1212.38, 'end_time' => 1213.2, 'target_text' => 'Say something.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah sesuatu.', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1213.3, 'end_time' => 1214.04, 'target_text' => 'How many years?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa tahun?', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1214.14, 'end_time' => 1214.6, 'target_text' => '>> 70.', 'source_text' => 'Ada yang menjawab: "70 tahun."', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1214.7, 'end_time' => 1215.72, 'target_text' => '>> 70.', 'source_text' => '"70 tahun."', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1215.82, 'end_time' => 1216.88, 'target_text' => 'We\'re almost there.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian daripada kita sudah hampir mencecah usia itu.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1216.98, 'end_time' => 1217.72, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1217.82, 'end_time' => 1222.68, 'target_text' => 'In this masjid, I can pick out at least 10 people who are beyond 70, maybe more, right now in front of me.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam masjid ini sahaja, saya dapat melihat sekurang-kurangnya 10 orang yang telah menjangkau usia 70 tahun, mungkin lebih ramai lagi di hadapan saya sekarang.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1222.78, 'end_time' => 1223.92, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant us a good life.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan umur yang berkah dan kehidupan yang baik kepada kita.', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1224.03, 'end_time' => 1224.48, 'target_text' => 'But, he\'s right.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jawapan tadi tepat sekali.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1224.59, 'end_time' => 1229.61, 'target_text' => '70 Amalu ummati ma baina sittina ila sab\'in.', 'source_text' => '70 tahun. "A\'maru ummati ma baynas-sittina ila sab\'in."', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1229.7, 'end_time' => 1231.16, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a shocking Hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Hadis ini amat menginsafkan jiwa.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1231.27, 'end_time' => 1240.53, 'target_text' => 'The Hadith says, "The age The average age of the members of my ummah between 60 and 70." That\'s a scary Hadith because we\'re', 'source_text' => 'Sabda Nabi: "Umur rata-rata umatku adalah antara 60 hingga 70 tahun." Hadis ini menggetarkan hati kerana kita semua sudah', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1240.62, 'end_time' => 1241.44, 'target_text' => 'almost there.', 'source_text' => 'hampir ke penghujung usia tersebut.', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1241.55, 'end_time' => 1243.01, 'target_text' => 'And some of us are already there.', 'source_text' => 'Malah sebahagian daripada kita telah pun melepasi lingkungan umur itu.', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1243.11, 'end_time' => 1244.16, 'target_text' => 'Now, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Kini, apakah yang patut kita lakukan?', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1244.27, 'end_time' => 1244.96, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t worry.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan berputus asa atau bimbang.', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1245.07, 'end_time' => 1245.88, 'target_text' => 'Take it in your stride.', 'source_text' => 'Hadapilah hakikat ini dengan tenang dan lapang dada.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1245.98, 'end_time' => 1247.48, 'target_text' => 'Are you not a worshiper of Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah anda seorang hamba yang menyembah Allah?', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1247.59, 'end_time' => 1248.09, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, sudah tentu!', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1248.18, 'end_time' => 1249.88, 'target_text' => 'Then, inshallah, we\'re going to Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka dengan kehendak Allah, kita menuju ke syurga.', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1249.98, 'end_time' => 1251.81, 'target_text' => 'We\'re going to Jannah by the will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita menuju ke syurga dengan rahmat dan keizinan Allah.', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1251.9, 'end_time' => 1252.88, 'target_text' => 'Clean your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Bersihkanlah hati anda.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1252.98, 'end_time' => 1253.88, 'target_text' => 'Try your best.', 'source_text' => 'Berusahalah sebaik mungkin.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1253.98, 'end_time' => 1255.44, 'target_text' => 'Seek the forgiveness of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Pohonlah keampunan daripada Allah.', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1255.55, 'end_time' => 1258.16, 'target_text' => 'Spend a little time', 'source_text' => 'Luangkanlah sedikit masa', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1258.27, 'end_time' => 1259.05, 'target_text' => 'with the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'bersama Al-Quran.', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1259.14, 'end_time' => 1265.85, 'target_text' => 'Like I asked a question earlier, and I was saying, "How much time do we spend to earn a living?" We go to work from 8:00 to', 'source_text' => 'Seperti yang saya tanyakan tadi: "Berapa banyak masa kita habiskan untuk mencari nafkah?" Kita bekerja dari jam 8:00 pagi hingga', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1265.94, 'end_time' => 1266.3, 'target_text' => '5:00.', 'source_text' => '5:00 petang.', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1266.31, 'end_time' => 1272.72, 'target_text' => 'We have a break, maybe a tea break half an hour, maybe a lunch break for 1 hour, and then we we\'re knocking off going home.', 'source_text' => 'Kita berehat minum teh setengah jam, berehat makan tengah hari 1 jam, dan selepas tamat waktu kerja kita pulang ke rumah.', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1272.83, 'end_time' => 1275.05, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Maka Allah berpesan: "Tahukah kamu?', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1275.14, 'end_time' => 1277.61, 'target_text' => 'Spend a few minutes with the Quran every day.', 'source_text' => 'Luangkanlah beberapa minit bersama Al-Quran pada setiap hari.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1277.7, 'end_time' => 1278.24, 'target_text' => 'Few minutes.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya beberapa minit.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1278.35, 'end_time' => 1278.96, 'target_text' => '2 minutes.', 'source_text' => 'Sekadar 2 minit sahaja.', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1279.07, 'end_time' => 1283.81, 'target_text' => 'Is it too much?" You see, the Quran, my brothers and sisters, is magnetizing.', 'source_text' => 'Adakah itu terlalu membebankan?" Ketahuilah bahawa Al-Quran ini, wahai saudara-saudariku, memiliki tarikan yang luar biasa.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1283.9, 'end_time' => 1288.37, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the only word of Allah in our midst that is unchanged.', 'source_text' => 'Ia satu-satunya kalam Allah di tengah-tengah kita yang terpelihara tanpa sebarang perubahan.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1288.46, 'end_time' => 1289.68, 'target_text' => 'Only word.', 'source_text' => 'Satu-satunya kalam-Nya.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1289.79, 'end_time' => 1290.77, 'target_text' => 'Unchanged.', 'source_text' => 'Terpelihara kekal abadi.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1290.87, 'end_time' => 1299.57, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s so magnetizing that when a person makes the time to read even 1 minute, the following day it will increase.', 'source_text' => 'Al-Quran memiliki daya penarik yang begitu kuat sehinggakan apabila seseorang meluangkan masa membacanya walau 1 minit, pada keesokan harinya ia akan bertambah.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1299.66, 'end_time' => 1307.29, 'target_text' => 'In the next few days, by the time 40, 50 days have passed of pushing yourself, you will not enjoy your day without reading', 'source_text' => 'Dalam beberapa hari seterusnya, apabila anda mendisiplinkan diri selama 40 atau 50 hari, anda tidak akan merasa tenang melalui hari anda tanpa membaca', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1307.38, 'end_time' => 1308.01, 'target_text' => 'the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Al-Quran.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1308.11, 'end_time' => 1310.05, 'target_text' => 'The same thing happens to salatul Fajr.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang sama juga berlaku kepada solat Subuh.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1310.14, 'end_time' => 1316.4, 'target_text' => 'When you force yourself to get up on time, you find after 40, 50 days, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda melatih diri bangun tepat pada waktunya, anda dapati selepas 40 atau 50 hari, apakah yang berlaku?', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1316.51, 'end_time' => 1317.61, 'target_text' => 'Your eye opens on its own.', 'source_text' => 'Mata anda akan celik dengan sendirinya.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1317.7, 'end_time' => 1318.61, 'target_text' => 'No alarm needed.', 'source_text' => 'Langsung tidak memerlukan jam penggera.', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1318.7, 'end_time' => 1321.09, 'target_text' => '2 minutes before the alarm, your eyes open, you turn it off.', 'source_text' => '2 minit sebelum penggera berbunyi, mata anda sudah terbuka dan anda sendiri yang mematikannya.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1321.18, 'end_time' => 1322.68, 'target_text' => 'It There we are.', 'source_text' => 'Di situlah buktinya.', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1322.79, 'end_time' => 1323.68, 'target_text' => 'Allah called you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah yang membangunkan anda.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1323.79, 'end_time' => 1328.37, 'target_text' => 'He invited you because initially you showed the interest.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menjemput anda kerana pada awalnya anda sendiri yang menunjukkan kesungguhan dan keazaman.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1328.46, 'end_time' => 1329.53, 'target_text' => 'You showed the interest.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menunjukkan kesungguhan hati.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1329.62, 'end_time' => 1335.33, 'target_text' => 'When you show the interest, Allah says, "Come." Because the Hadith says, "Whoever comes to Allah walking, Allah comes to him', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda menunjukkan keazaman, Allah berfirman: "Marilah." Kerana sabda Nabi dalam hadis: "Sesiapa yang datang kepada Allah berjalan, Allah datang kepadanya', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1335.42, 'end_time' => 1340.53, 'target_text' => 'rushing, faster than that." Allah\'s always more than you and I in goodness.', 'source_text' => 'berlari dengan jauh lebih pantas." Kebaikan dan rahmat Allah sentiasa melimpah melebihi apa yang kita sangkakan.', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1340.62, 'end_time' => 1347.61, 'target_text' => 'So, if you can spend 2 minutes with the Quran, automatically it will become 5 and 10, and before you know it, as you grow', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, sekiranya anda dapat meluangkan 2 minit bersama Al-Quran, secara automatik ia akan berkembang menjadi 5 dan 10 minit, dan sedar tidak sedar apabila usia anda meningkat,', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1347.71, 'end_time' => 1355.69, 'target_text' => 'older, every morning, before anything, you have salatul Fajr, you have a little bit of your Quran recital, you can have your', 'source_text' => 'pada setiap pagi sebelum memulakan apa-apa urusan, anda dirikan solat Subuh, membaca sedikit ayat Al-Quran, kemudian barulah anda menikmati', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1355.79, 'end_time' => 1360.89, 'target_text' => 'tea, whatever, and you can go to your gym or your exercise, but it starts with the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'secawan teh atau sarapan, lalu pergi bersenam atau ke gimnasium; namun harimu sentiasa bermula dengan Al-Quran.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1360.99, 'end_time' => 1361.97, 'target_text' => 'You know what that is?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah erti semua itu?', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1362.07, 'end_time' => 1364.73, 'target_text' => 'It\'s preparing for the day you\'re going to go back to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah persiapan menghadapi hari kepulangan anda mengadap Allah.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1364.83, 'end_time' => 1371.45, 'target_text' => 'The angels will say, "This man started his day with Fajr, and then he recited the Quran." You think that\'s a bad death?', 'source_text' => 'Para malaikat akan menjadi saksi: "Insan ini memulakan harinya dengan Subuh, kemudian mengalunkan Al-Quran." Adakah anda rasa itu pengakhiran yang buruk?', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1371.55, 'end_time' => 1374.57, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a very good death, by the will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah pengakhiran husnul khatimah yang amat mulia dengan kehendak Allah.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1374.67, 'end_time' => 1376.45, 'target_text' => 'But if you want to die that way, start it.', 'source_text' => 'Namun jika anda ingin mati dalam keadaan sebegitu, mulakanlah ia dari sekarang.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1376.55, 'end_time' => 1378.05, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why we\'re talking today.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kita berkumpul dan berbincang pada hari ini.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1378.15, 'end_time' => 1380.97, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why we gathered the people today, and we said, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kita menghimpunkan para jemaah pada hari ini dan berkata:', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1381.07, 'end_time' => 1385.49, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s gather them every month." We need a reminder, short reminder.', 'source_text' => '"Mari kita adakan perhimpunan sebegini pada setiap bulan." Kita memerlukan peringatan, sekadar tazkirah ringkas.', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1385.59, 'end_time' => 1387.93, 'target_text' => 'And inshallah, WE GO HOME EMPOWERED.', 'source_text' => 'Dan insya-Allah, kita pulang ke rumah dengan jiwa yang lebih bersemangat dan terisi.', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1388.03, 'end_time' => 1394.01, 'target_text' => 'WE FEEL FRESH, WE FEEL GOOD AGAIN, and inshallah, we come back and come to the masjid, go to any masjid, but make sure you', 'source_text' => 'KITA BERASA SEGAR, KITA KEMBALI BERSEMANGAT, dan insya-Allah kita kembali hadir ke masjid; pergilah ke mana-mana masjid sekalipun, namun pastikan anda', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1394.11, 'end_time' => 1394.73, 'target_text' => 'are there.', 'source_text' => 'benar-benar hadir mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1394.83, 'end_time' => 1399.93, 'target_text' => 'Pray on time, make time for the Quran, make time for Allah, even if it\'s a little.', 'source_text' => 'Solatlah di awal waktu, luangkanlah masa untuk Al-Quran, peruntukkanlah waktu untuk Allah, walau hanya sedikit.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1400.03, 'end_time' => 1406.57, 'target_text' => 'Now, why is it that when you read the Quran a little, it actually magnetizes you.', 'source_text' => 'Kini timbul persoalan, mengapakah apabila anda membaca sedikit Al-Quran, ia sebenarnya memberi daya penarik yang luar biasa?', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1406.67, 'end_time' => 1410.45, 'target_text' => 'Simple reason, Allah is the owner of time.', 'source_text' => 'Sebabnya amat mudah, kerana Allah adalah Pemilik masa.', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1410.55, 'end_time' => 1414.05, 'target_text' => 'When you think you don\'t have time, you are rejected.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda menyangka bahawa anda tidak mempunyai masa untuk-Nya, anda sebenarnya terhalang daripada keberkatan.', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1414.15, 'end_time' => 1420.37, 'target_text' => 'When you are when you believe I\'m making a little bit of time, the owner of time blesses your time.', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda berazam meluangkan sedikit masa untuk-Nya, Pemilik masa akan melimpahkan keberkatan pada seluruh waktu anda.', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1420.47, 'end_time' => 1422.73, 'target_text' => 'Your day has so much blessings.', 'source_text' => 'Hari yang anda lalui akan dipenuhi dengan keberkatan yang melimpah-ruah.', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1422.83, 'end_time' => 1431.29, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, if you start your day with salatul Fajr and some Quran, you will end your day doing more than you thought you would', 'source_text' => 'Demi Allah, sekiranya anda memulakan hari anda dengan solat Subuh dan sedikit bacaan Al-Quran, anda akan mengakhiri hari tersebut dengan menyelesaikan jauh lebih banyak urusan', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1431.39, 'end_time' => 1437.45, 'target_text' => 'be able to do in that day, and you will be back home thinking, "Hey, there\'s still a lot of time." Guess what?', 'source_text' => 'daripada apa yang anda jangkakan, lalu pulang ke rumah sambil berfikir: "Eh, masih banyak lagi waktu terluang." Cuba teka mengapa?', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1437.55, 'end_time' => 1443.01, 'target_text' => 'When you were thinking there was no time, the owner of time gave blessings in that time.', 'source_text' => 'Di saat anda menyangka tiada masa mencukupi, Pemilik segala masa telah mengurniakan keberkatan pada setiap saat waktu anda.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1443.11, 'end_time' => 1444.21, 'target_text' => 'That\'s Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah kebesaran Allah.', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1444.31, 'end_time' => 1445.17, 'target_text' => 'That\'s Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1445.27, 'end_time' => 1446.37, 'target_text' => 'Believe it.', 'source_text' => 'Yakinilah hakikat ini.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1446.47, 'end_time' => 1452.81, 'target_text' => 'So, my brothers and sisters, inshallah, as much as there is a lot of hopelessness, a lot of problems on earth, but I tell', 'source_text' => 'Maka, wahai saudara-saudariku sekalian, insya-Allah, walaupun terdapat banyak keputusasaan dan kemelut di muka bumi hari ini, namun saya tegaskan', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1452.91, 'end_time' => 1457.65, 'target_text' => 'you, grassroots, one of the ways of resolving the matter', 'source_text' => 'kepada anda di peringkat akar umbi, salah satu kaedah utama untuk merungkaikan masalah ini', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1457.75, 'end_time' => 1461.77, 'target_text' => 'is to improve our relationship with one another, by the will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'ialah dengan memperelokkan hubungan sesama kita, dengan kehendak dan keizinan Allah.', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1461.87, 'end_time' => 1465.61, 'target_text' => 'Because people say, "Look, these countries are fighting each other." And we know, we are saddened.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana orang sering berkata: "Lihatlah, negara-negara ini sedang berperang sesama sendiri." Dan kita mengetahuinya, hati kita berduka lara.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1465.71, 'end_time' => 1466.29, 'target_text' => 'Who are we?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah kita?', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1466.39, 'end_time' => 1468.09, 'target_text' => 'We are people caught in the crossfire.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah orang awam yang terperangkap dalam kancah pergolakan ini.', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1468.19, 'end_time' => 1469.17, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want these wars.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak menginginkan peperangan sebegini.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1469.27, 'end_time' => 1470.81, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t want killing and fighting.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak mahu pembunuhan dan pertumpahan darah.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1470.91, 'end_time' => 1475.09, 'target_text' => 'We are peaceful people and people are laughing at us to say look at this religion of peace.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah umat yang mencintai keamanan, namun orang lain mentertawakan kita seraya mengejek kononnya inilah \'agama kedamaian\'.', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1475.19, 'end_time' => 1476.49, 'target_text' => 'Look at what you guys are doing.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berkata: "Tengoklah apa yang kamu semua lakukan."', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1476.59, 'end_time' => 1478.01, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not us.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bukan cerminan hakiki kita.', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1478.11, 'end_time' => 1484.45, 'target_text' => 'It\'s people who have not been reminded constantly to resolve their disputes by sitting with each other, by talking to each', 'source_text' => 'Pergolakan itu berlaku kerana manusia tidak diingatkan secara berterusan agar menyelesaikan perselisihan dengan duduk semeja, berbincang secara berhemah,', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1484.55, 'end_time' => 1491.97, 'target_text' => 'other, by perhaps by other means to be able to understand each other, be fair, be just, learn to talk to people, learn to', 'source_text' => 'serta menggunakan jalan damai untuk saling memahami, bersikap adil, bersikap saksama, belajar berkomunikasi, belajar memperkasakan', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1492.07, 'end_time' => 1495.81, 'target_text' => 'empower, and don\'t let it be only about yourself.', 'source_text' => 'sesama ummah, dan jangan sesekali hanya mementingkan diri sendiri.', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1495.91, 'end_time' => 1499.09, 'target_text' => 'The minute we are selfish, we will never solve problems.', 'source_text' => 'Saat kita bersikap mementingkan diri sendiri, kita tidak akan sesekali mampu menyelesaikan sebarang masalah.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1499.19, 'end_time' => 1501.17, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless every one of us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa merahmati setiap seorang daripada kita.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1501.27, 'end_time' => 1504.09, 'target_text' => 'My brothers and sisters, the favors of Allah are many.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudariku sekalian, nikmat kurniaan Allah itu amat banyak.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1504.19, 'end_time' => 1513.61, 'target_text' => 'The Quran says, "Wa in ta\'uddu ni\'mat Allahi la tuhsuha, if you\'re going to try and count the favors of Allah upon you, you', 'source_text' => 'Firman Allah di dalam Al-Quran: "Wa in ta\'uddu ni\'matallahi la tuhsuha." Sekiranya kamu cuba menghitung nikmat Allah ke atas kamu, kamu', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1513.71, 'end_time' => 1516.09, 'target_text' => 'will never be able to count them." That\'s what Allah says.', 'source_text' => 'tidak akan sesekali mampu menghitungnya." Begitulah penegasan Allah.', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1516.19, 'end_time' => 1526.39, 'target_text' => 'So, we can continue talking about the favors of Allah, and we will continue talking about them, and we will never ever end.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita boleh terus membicarakan tentang nikmat Allah, dan kita akan terus memperkatakannya, tanpa akan pernah ada penghujungnya.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1526.99, 'end_time' => 1530.13, 'target_text' => 'One of the favors of Allah', 'source_text' => 'Salah satu nikmat Allah', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1530.23, 'end_time' => 1532.45, 'target_text' => 'is that your problems', 'source_text' => 'ialah hakikat bahawa masalah anda', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1532.55, 'end_time' => 1534.79, 'target_text' => 'you can count them.', 'source_text' => 'sebenarnya boleh dihitung satu demi satu.', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1535.31, 'end_time' => 1537.85, 'target_text' => 'You know, the opposite of the favor', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda, lawan bagi nikmat', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1537.95, 'end_time' => 1538.65, 'target_text' => 'is what?', 'source_text' => 'adalah apa?', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1538.75, 'end_time' => 1542.29, 'target_text' => 'You can call it a test, you can call it an issue, you can call it something negative.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh memanggilnya sebagai ujian, sebagai musibah, atau perkara yang negatif.', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1542.39, 'end_time' => 1546.73, 'target_text' => 'The negatives in your life, I swear you can count them.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara negatif dalam hidup anda, demi Allah anda boleh menghitung bilangannya.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1546.83, 'end_time' => 1549.73, 'target_text' => 'Any one of us, if I ask you, "How many problems do you have?', 'source_text' => 'Sesiapa sahaja antara kita, jika saya bertanya: "Berapakah jumlah masalah yang sedang anda hadapi?', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1549.83, 'end_time' => 1556.19, 'target_text' => 'Name them." And the guy will start, I swear he\'ll name five or six things and he\'ll stop.', 'source_text' => 'Sebutkan satu persatu." Orang itu akan mula menyenaraikannya, demi Allah dia menyebut lima atau enam perkara lalu terhenti.', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1556.39, 'end_time' => 1558.25, 'target_text' => 'And then, what did Allah bless you with?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jika ditanya apa pula nikmat yang Allah kurniakan kepada anda?', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1558.35, 'end_time' => 1560.49, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t know where to start.', 'source_text' => 'Anda langsung tidak tahu di mana hendak memulakannya kerana terlalu banyak!', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1560.59, 'end_time' => 1569.29, 'target_text' => 'So, we have made a perception of Allah based on things we can count in our on our fingers.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita sering membina tanggapan terhadap Allah hanya berpandukan beberapa ujian yang boleh kita hitung dengan jari jemari kita.', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1569.39, 'end_time' => 1570.09, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not fair.', 'source_text' => 'Itu sungguh tidak adil.', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1570.19, 'end_time' => 1573.85, 'target_text' => 'Allah\'s blessed you with so much and so much more.', 'source_text' => 'Allah telah mengurniakan nikmat yang teramat luas dan melimpah-ruah kepada anda.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1573.95, 'end_time' => 1578.09, 'target_text' => 'So, Allah says, "When I\'ve given you, I want you to come to me.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu Allah berpesan: "Saat Aku melimpahkan nikmat kepadamu, Aku mahu kamu mendekati-Ku.', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1578.19, 'end_time' => 1585.13, 'target_text' => 'And when I take away from you, I want you to come to me." Because some people don\'t come to Allah until he takes it away.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saat Aku menarik sedikit nikmat daripadamu, Aku tetap mahu kamu kembali kepada-Ku." Kerana sesetengah manusia tidak mahu mendekati Allah sehinggalah Dia mengambil nikmat tersebut.', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1585.23, 'end_time' => 1587.41, 'target_text' => 'It happens, right?', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ini sering berlaku, bukan?', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1587.51, 'end_time' => 1593.49, 'target_text' => 'So, Allah says, "When I bless you, come to me so that I don\'t have to take it away from you for you to come to me.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu Allah berpesan: "Apabila Aku melimpahkan nikmat kepadamu, datanglah kepada-Ku, agar Aku tidak perlu menarik nikmat itu semata-mata untuk membuatkanmu kembali mengadap-Ku.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1593.59, 'end_time' => 1599.53, 'target_text' => 'So, I give you an example and inshallah we\'ll end with this point, perhaps one more point.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya kongsikan satu contoh, dan insya-Allah kita akan menyimpulkan ceramah ini dengan poin ini, mungkin ditambah satu poin lagi.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1599.63, 'end_time' => 1606.01, 'target_text' => 'When a person is well and healthy and everything\'s going good and they\'re good-looking and they\'re young, sometimes Allah', 'source_text' => 'Ketika seseorang itu sihat bertenaga, segala urusannya lancar, berwajah tampan atau cantik, dan masih muda, kadangkala ingatan kepada Allah', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1606.11, 'end_time' => 1608.37, 'target_text' => 'Almighty just plays a role in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Yang Maha Kuasa sekadar diletakkan di sudut latar belakang hidupnya sahaja.', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1608.47, 'end_time' => 1609.01, 'target_text' => 'Astaghfirullah.', 'source_text' => 'Astaghfirullah.', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1609.11, 'end_time' => 1611.45, 'target_text' => 'May Allah forgive us and grant us strength.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengampuni kita dan mengurniakan kekuatan kepada kita.', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1611.55, 'end_time' => 1613.97, 'target_text' => 'And whatever he has said, "Okay, I\'m a Muslim and you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Lalu orang itu sekadar berkata: "Ya, saya seorang Muslim, dan tahukah anda?', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1614.07, 'end_time' => 1615.73, 'target_text' => 'But by the way, it\'s in the background.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi pegangan agama itu sekadar sampingan sahaja.', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1615.83, 'end_time' => 1623.57, 'target_text' => 'Not too not too serious." And Allah loves this person because of their heart perhaps being in in the right place or a kind-hearted', 'source_text' => 'Tidaklah terlalu bersungguh-sungguh." Namun Allah menyayangi hamba ini mungkin kerana hatinya masih ada kebaikan atau dia seorang yang pemurah dan berhati mulia,', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1623.67, 'end_time' => 1625.21, 'target_text' => 'person, whatever it might be.', 'source_text' => 'walau apa jua kebaikan tersembunyi yang ada padanya.', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1625.31, 'end_time' => 1626.13, 'target_text' => 'So, what does Allah do?', 'source_text' => 'Maka apakah yang Allah lakukan?', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1626.23, 'end_time' => 1627.65, 'target_text' => 'Allah taps them.', 'source_text' => 'Allah menegurnya dengan kasih sayang.', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1627.75, 'end_time' => 1628.73, 'target_text' => 'Through what?', 'source_text' => 'Melalui apa?', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1628.83, 'end_time' => 1630.97, 'target_text' => 'Some test in their lives.', 'source_text' => 'Melalui sedikit ujian dalam hidup mereka.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1631.07, 'end_time' => 1631.81, 'target_text' => 'Whatever the tests are.', 'source_text' => 'Apa jua bentuk ujian tersebut.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1631.91, 'end_time' => 1637.53, 'target_text' => 'They Tests are many, sickness, loss of job, perhaps disturbance in something, perhaps a health matter.', 'source_text' => 'Ujian itu pelbagai ragam: jatuh sakit, kehilangan pekerjaan, gangguan dalam urusan, atau masalah kesihatan.', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1637.63, 'end_time' => 1638.93, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant goodness to everyone.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan kebaikan kepada semua orang.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1639.03, 'end_time' => 1640.65, 'target_text' => 'But these are some of the tests of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun inilah antara bentuk ujian daripada Allah.', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1640.75, 'end_time' => 1649.17, 'target_text' => 'I promise you, if that test of Allah brings you closer to him, it was a gift of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berjanji kepada anda, sekiranya ujian Allah itu menjadikan anda semakin dekat kepada-Nya, maka hakikatnya ia adalah satu hadiah kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1649.27, 'end_time' => 1650.41, 'target_text' => 'It was a gift of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ia sesungguhnya adalah hadiah terindah daripada Allah.', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1650.51, 'end_time' => 1654.09, 'target_text' => 'Can never be a punishment because what happened?', 'source_text' => 'Ia sama sekali bukan satu azab hukuman, kerana apakah kesudahannya?', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1654.19, 'end_time' => 1658.77, 'target_text' => 'I never used to pray, but after this happened, something happened in my life, I started praying.', 'source_text' => '"Dahulu saya tidak pernah solat, namun selepas peristiwa ini berlaku dalam hidup saya, saya mula mendirikan solat."', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1658.87, 'end_time' => 1661.13, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah nikmat kurniaan Allah yang teramat besar.', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1661.23, 'end_time' => 1667.57, 'target_text' => 'More people tell you that when something negative happened, they started praying than the number of people who tell you when', 'source_text' => 'Jauh lebih ramai orang mengaku bahawa saat musibah melanda barulah mereka mula solat, berbanding bilangan orang yang mengaku mula solat ketika', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1667.67, 'end_time' => 1669.89, 'target_text' => 'something positive happened, they started praying.', 'source_text' => 'menerima nikmat kejayaan dan kesenangan.', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1669.99, 'end_time' => 1674.73, 'target_text' => 'How many guys, when they\'ve made a million, 2 million, 3 million, they come more to the masjid?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai orang yang apabila meraih kekayaan 1 juta, 2 juta, atau 3 juta, mereka semakin kerap hadir mengimarahkan masjid?', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1674.83, 'end_time' => 1676.29, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the winner.', 'source_text' => 'Orang itulah pemenang sejati!', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1676.39, 'end_time' => 1677.61, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the winner.', 'source_text' => 'Dialah insan yang benar-benar berjaya.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1677.71, 'end_time' => 1679.09, 'target_text' => 'But usually it\'s the other way around.', 'source_text' => 'Namun lazimnya berlaku sebaliknya.', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1679.19, 'end_time' => 1681.81, 'target_text' => 'When you lost a million, then you come to the masjid.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda kehilangan sejuta ringgit, barulah anda melangkah ke masjid.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1681.91, 'end_time' => 1682.31, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 482],
            ['start_time' => 1682.35, 'end_time' => 1683.69, 'target_text' => 'So, this is all the favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka semua ini membuktikan rahmat dan hikmah nikmat Allah.', 'order' => 483],
            ['start_time' => 1683.79, 'end_time' => 1685.69, 'target_text' => 'He knows what he\'s doing.', 'source_text' => 'Dia Maha Mengetahui apa yang terbaik dilakukan-Nya.', 'order' => 484],
            ['start_time' => 1685.79, 'end_time' => 1687.53, 'target_text' => 'We need inshallah the goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mendambakan kebaikan dengan izin Allah.', 'order' => 485],
            ['start_time' => 1687.63, 'end_time' => 1694.61, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless us and grant us like the dua says, "Rabbana atina fid-dunya hasanatan wa fil-akhirati hasanatan waqina adhaban-nar."', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memberkati kita dan mengurniakan doa: "Rabbana atina fid-dunya hasanah, wa fil-akhirati hasanah, wa qina \'azaban-nar."', 'order' => 486],
            ['start_time' => 1694.71, 'end_time' => 1697.25, 'target_text' => 'Have hope, instill hope in others.', 'source_text' => 'Milikilah harapan, dan tanamkanlah harapan dalam jiwa insan lain.', 'order' => 487],
            ['start_time' => 1697.35, 'end_time' => 1703.09, 'target_text' => 'When you say when you talk about the situation, try to talk to people about the positives.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda membicarakan tentang sesuatu keadaan, cubalah ketengahkan perkara-perkara yang positif.', 'order' => 488],
            ['start_time' => 1703.19, 'end_time' => 1705.77, 'target_text' => 'You know, I\'m from Zimbabwe just like all of you.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, saya berasal dari Zimbabwe sama seperti anda semua.', 'order' => 489],
            ['start_time' => 1705.87, 'end_time' => 1711.85, 'target_text' => 'When we travel and we say we\'re from Zimbabwe, they really think we live in a dump.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila kita bermusafir dan memberitahu kita dari Zimbabwe, orang luar menyangka kita hidup di tempat yang serba daif.', 'order' => 490],
            ['start_time' => 1711.95, 'end_time' => 1715.79, 'target_text' => 'And I promise you, when you come here', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya beritahu anda, apabila anda datang ke sini,', 'order' => 491],
            ['start_time' => 1716.99, 'end_time' => 1718.13, 'target_text' => 'what should I say?', 'source_text' => 'apa yang patut saya katakan?', 'order' => 492],
            ['start_time' => 1718.23, 'end_time' => 1721.26, 'target_text' => 'You can see the dump from a distance, right?', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh melihatnya dari kejauhan, bukan?', 'order' => 493],
            ['start_time' => 1721.36, 'end_time' => 1726.77, 'target_text' => '>> [laughter] >> But to be honest, mashallah, we have fresh food, we have organic food, we\'re okay.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi secara jujurnya, masha Allah, kita ada makanan segar, makanan organik, dan kehidupan kita baik-baik sahaja.', 'order' => 494],
            ['start_time' => 1726.87, 'end_time' => 1729.25, 'target_text' => 'We\'re earning dollars, we\'re having It\'s fine.', 'source_text' => 'Kita memperoleh pendapatan mata wang dolar, dan segalanya terkawal.', 'order' => 495],
            ['start_time' => 1729.35, 'end_time' => 1731.41, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah, people are surviving.', 'source_text' => 'Masha Allah, rakyat kita mampu bertahan hidup.', 'order' => 496],
            ['start_time' => 1731.51, 'end_time' => 1734.81, 'target_text' => 'You know, so we don\'t need to worry that inside, "Hey, life is tough.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi kita tidak perlu terlalu mengeluh: "Alahai, hidup ini terlalu sukar.', 'order' => 497],
            ['start_time' => 1734.91, 'end_time' => 1737.93, 'target_text' => 'Life is so tough." Relax, we\'re all in it together.', 'source_text' => 'Hidup ini begitu perit." Bertenanglah, kita semua melaluinya bersama-sama.', 'order' => 498],
            ['start_time' => 1738.03, 'end_time' => 1741.97, 'target_text' => 'The prices all over the world have gone up.', 'source_text' => 'Harga barangan di seluruh dunia sedang meningkat naik.', 'order' => 499],
            ['start_time' => 1742.07, 'end_time' => 1743.41, 'target_text' => 'Everywhere, things have gone up.', 'source_text' => 'Di mana-mana sahaja di dunia ini, kos sara hidup meningkat.', 'order' => 500],
            ['start_time' => 1743.51, 'end_time' => 1744.49, 'target_text' => 'Go and check it out.', 'source_text' => 'Pergilah menyemak sendiri kebenarannya.', 'order' => 501],
            ['start_time' => 1744.59, 'end_time' => 1745.49, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not just us.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan negara kita sahaja yang melaluinya.', 'order' => 502],
            ['start_time' => 1745.59, 'end_time' => 1752.01, 'target_text' => 'So, when we gather and we empower each other, you know, when we\'re together, the difficulty becomes easy.', 'source_text' => 'Maka apabila kita berkumpul dan saling memberi sokongan, anda tahu bukan, saat kita bersatu padu, perkara yang sukar akan menjadi mudah.', 'order' => 503],
            ['start_time' => 1752.11, 'end_time' => 1753.25, 'target_text' => 'We\'re all together.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua menghadapinya bersama-sama.', 'order' => 504],
            ['start_time' => 1753.35, 'end_time' => 1755.13, 'target_text' => 'When you go for Hajj, Hajj is not a joke.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda menunaikan ibadah haji, haji bukanlah suatu perkara main-main.', 'order' => 505],
            ['start_time' => 1755.23, 'end_time' => 1757.05, 'target_text' => 'Hajj is not so easy.', 'source_text' => 'Ibadah haji bukanlah semudah yang disangka.', 'order' => 506],
            ['start_time' => 1757.15, 'end_time' => 1760.17, 'target_text' => 'Hajj is not so easy even with all the facilities, not so easy.', 'source_text' => 'Haji menuntut pengorbanan yang berat walaupun dilengkapi pelbagai kemudahan serba moden, tetap tidak mudah.', 'order' => 507],
            ['start_time' => 1760.27, 'end_time' => 1764.73, 'target_text' => 'But when you\'re in a group of people and you\'re going together, everything becomes easy.', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila anda berada dalam kumpulan jemaah dan bergerak bersama-sama, segalanya terasa begitu mudah dan ringan.', 'order' => 508],
            ['start_time' => 1764.83, 'end_time' => 1765.45, 'target_text' => 'Because you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Kerana tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 509],
            ['start_time' => 1765.55, 'end_time' => 1766.49, 'target_text' => 'We\'re all going together.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana kita semua melangkah seiringan bersama-sama.', 'order' => 510],
            ['start_time' => 1766.59, 'end_time' => 1767.97, 'target_text' => 'You come for salat al-jama\'ah.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu juga apabila anda hadir untuk solat berjemaah.', 'order' => 511],
            ['start_time' => 1768.07, 'end_time' => 1769.45, 'target_text' => 'We sit here, we\'re doing it together.', 'source_text' => 'Kita duduk di sini, kita menunaikannya bersama-sama.', 'order' => 512],
            ['start_time' => 1769.55, 'end_time' => 1772.01, 'target_text' => 'My Maghrib was done, my Isha is done.', 'source_text' => 'Solat Maghrib saya selesai dengan sempurna, solat Isyak saya juga selesai.', 'order' => 513],
            ['start_time' => 1772.11, 'end_time' => 1774.13, 'target_text' => 'Go home and try reading it alone.', 'source_text' => 'Cuba anda pulang ke rumah dan mendirikannya seorang diri.', 'order' => 514],
            ['start_time' => 1774.23, 'end_time' => 1776.77, 'target_text' => 'Hey, you\'re sitting [clears throat] and you\'re thinking I\'ve got Isha to do.', 'source_text' => 'Anda duduk termenung sambil berfikir: "Aku masih belum solat Isyak."', 'order' => 515],
            ['start_time' => 1776.87, 'end_time' => 1778.21, 'target_text' => 'And a little while later, it\'s 10:00.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak lama kemudian, jam sudah menunjukkan pukul 10:00 malam.', 'order' => 516],
            ['start_time' => 1778.31, 'end_time' => 1779.65, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve got to sleep, I\'ve got Isha to do.', 'source_text' => '"Aku sudah mengantuk hendak tidur, tapi Isyak belum selesai."', 'order' => 517],
            ['start_time' => 1779.75, 'end_time' => 1780.45, 'target_text' => 'Look what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah apa yang berlaku.', 'order' => 518],
            ['start_time' => 1780.55, 'end_time' => 1782.21, 'target_text' => 'Because you didn\'t do it together.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana anda tidak melakukannya secara berjemaah.', 'order' => 519],
            ['start_time' => 1782.31, 'end_time' => 1783.89, 'target_text' => 'Yadullahi ma\'al jama\'ah.', 'source_text' => '"Yadullahi ma\'al jama\'ah" (Pertolongan dan rahmat Allah sentiasa bersama jemaah).', 'order' => 520],
            ['start_time' => 1783.99, 'end_time' => 1788.97, 'target_text' => 'Allah Almighty tells us the the reward and the the benefit of doing things together.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Yang Maha Kuasa menegaskan ganjaran pahala dan hikmah kebaikan apabila kita melakukan sesuatu secara bersama.', 'order' => 521],
            ['start_time' => 1789.07, 'end_time' => 1790.33, 'target_text' => 'May Allah help us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah sentiasa membantu kita.', 'order' => 522],
            ['start_time' => 1790.43, 'end_time' => 1797.81, 'target_text' => 'We are here today by the will of Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala to give people a a a perspective that will instill within them', 'source_text' => 'Kita berhimpun di sini pada hari ini dengan izin Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala untuk memberikan sudut pandang yang mampu menanamkan ke dalam jiwa insan', 'order' => 523],
            ['start_time' => 1797.91, 'end_time' => 1799.05, 'target_text' => 'some hope.', 'source_text' => 'secubit harapan yang teguh.', 'order' => 524],
            ['start_time' => 1799.15, 'end_time' => 1800.57, 'target_text' => 'Refresh the energy.', 'source_text' => 'Menyegarkan kembali semangat dan kekuatan jiwa.', 'order' => 525],
            ['start_time' => 1800.67, 'end_time' => 1802.21, 'target_text' => 'And inshallah, things are well.', 'source_text' => 'Dan insya-Allah, segala urusan akan berjalan dengan baik.', 'order' => 526],
            ['start_time' => 1802.31, 'end_time' => 1804.57, 'target_text' => 'By the will of Allah, this country is booming.', 'source_text' => 'Dengan kehendak Allah, negara kita ini sedang berkembang pesat.', 'order' => 527],
            ['start_time' => 1804.67, 'end_time' => 1807.93, 'target_text' => 'Now, I\'m becoming a little bit of an economic analyst here.', 'source_text' => 'Kini saya seolah-olah menjadi penganalisis ekonomi pula di sini.', 'order' => 528],
            ['start_time' => 1808.03, 'end_time' => 1809.69, 'target_text' => 'But inshallah, hey, the country is booming.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi insya-Allah, negara kita ini sedang maju berkembang.', 'order' => 529],
            ['start_time' => 1809.79, 'end_time' => 1811.13, 'target_text' => 'Why should I say otherwise?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa pula saya perlu mengatakan sebaliknya?', 'order' => 530],
            ['start_time' => 1811.23, 'end_time' => 1813.77, 'target_text' => 'Imagine the angels are saying, "Amen." Why not?', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan para malaikat sedang mengaminkan doa ini: "Amin." Mengapa tidak?', 'order' => 531],
            ['start_time' => 1813.87, 'end_time' => 1816.17, 'target_text' => 'But if I keep on saying, "Hey, things are tough." You watch what\'s going to happen.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi sekiranya saya asyik meratapi: "Semuanya serba susah dan sempit." Lihatlah apa yang bakal menimpa kelak.', 'order' => 532],
            ['start_time' => 1816.27, 'end_time' => 1817.29, 'target_text' => 'Everybody\'s going to die.', 'source_text' => 'Semua orang akan berputus asa dan tertekan.', 'order' => 533],
            ['start_time' => 1817.39, 'end_time' => 1818.13, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to lose jobs.', 'source_text' => 'Anda risau kehilangan pekerjaan.', 'order' => 534],
            ['start_time' => 1818.23, 'end_time' => 1822.73, 'target_text' => 'You this Why doom the Already you have a mindset of a loser.', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa perlu memandang masa depan dengan kegelapan? Sikap begitu mencerminkan minda orang yang sudah tewas sebelum berjuang.', 'order' => 535],
            ['start_time' => 1822.83, 'end_time' => 1824.09, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa bersikap begitu?', 'order' => 536],
            ['start_time' => 1824.19, 'end_time' => 1825.09, 'target_text' => 'Keep it positive.', 'source_text' => 'Kekalkanlah fikiran yang positif.', 'order' => 537],
            ['start_time' => 1825.19, 'end_time' => 1826.05, 'target_text' => 'Inshallah, we\'ll do well.', 'source_text' => 'Insya-Allah, kita akan berjaya dan cemerlang.', 'order' => 538],
            ['start_time' => 1826.15, 'end_time' => 1827.93, 'target_text' => 'We lost today, tomorrow we\'re going to gain.', 'source_text' => 'Jika kita rugi hari ini, esok kita pasti akan memperoleh keuntungan.', 'order' => 539],
            ['start_time' => 1828.03, 'end_time' => 1830.33, 'target_text' => 'This year was a bad year, next year\'s going to be a good year.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya tahun ini penuh dengan cabaran, tahun hadapan pasti menjadi tahun yang penuh keberkatan.', 'order' => 540],
            ['start_time' => 1830.43, 'end_time' => 1831.61, 'target_text' => 'That is a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah jati diri seorang Muslim sejati.', 'order' => 541],
            ['start_time' => 1831.71, 'end_time' => 1833.25, 'target_text' => 'That is a believer.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sifat seorang mukmin yang teguh imannya.', 'order' => 542],
            ['start_time' => 1833.35, 'end_time' => 1834.61, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless all of us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah melimpahkan rahmat-Nya kepada kita semua.', 'order' => 543],
            ['start_time' => 1834.71, 'end_time' => 1840.37, 'target_text' => 'Anyone struggling with sickness and illness, our dua for you, may Allah grant you cure.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesiapa yang sedang bertarung melawan kesakitan dan penyakit, doa kami sentiasa bersama anda, semoga Allah mengurniakan kesembuhan yang sempurna.', 'order' => 544],
            ['start_time' => 1840.47, 'end_time' => 1844.53, 'target_text' => 'Anyone struggling with their jobs, with their sustenance, may Allah grant you sustenance.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesiapa yang sedang bergelut mencari rezeki dan pekerjaan, semoga Allah membukakan seluas-luas pintu rezeki untuk anda.', 'order' => 545],
            ['start_time' => 1844.63, 'end_time' => 1845.53, 'target_text' => 'May Allah provide for you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mencukupkan segala keperluan anda.', 'order' => 546],
            ['start_time' => 1845.63, 'end_time' => 1849.65, 'target_text' => 'Those who are struggling perhaps even to get married, it\'s no longer easy.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi mereka yang sedang berusaha untuk mendirikan rumah tangga, ia sememangnya bukan lagi perkara yang mudah pada masa kini.', 'order' => 547],
